    <li>Select <strong>PowerPoint</strong> from the sidebar navigation (or press the PowerPoint tab) to present fullscreen.</li>
    <li>Use arrow keys (<code>←</code> and <code>→</code>) to change slides; click <code>Present</code> for fullscreen mode.</li>
    <li>On Slide 30, toggle between <strong>Sources &amp; Uses Budgeting</strong> and <strong>Store Rollout Expansion Map</strong> to inspect store economics, catchments, and debt covenants.</li>
  </ol>
</section>
</div>

