,0."}, "sp_1": {"title": "Technological Changes: Score -5.0 (Rapid On-Demand Migration)", "title_id": "Pergeseran Teknologi: Skor -5,0 (Disrupsi Pengantaran Cepat)", "source": "e-Conomy SEA 2020; GrabMart/Shopee", "source_id": "e-Conomy SEA 2020; GrabMart/Shopee", "defense": "Quick-commerce delivery apps surged 54%, shifting impulse and pantry purchases directly to smartphones and bypassing physical shopping malls. Severe threat of -5.0.", "defense_id": "Aplikasi kurir instan melonjak 54%, mengalihkan belanja harian ke ponsel dan memotong kunjungan fisik ke mal belanja, menjadi disrupsi eksternal berat (-5,0)."}, "sp_2": {"title": "Price Elasticity: Score -4.0 (Zero Switching Costs)", "title_id": "Elastisitas Harga: Skor -4,0 (Biaya Peralihan Konsumen Nol)", "source": "CPM Analysis; Consumer Price Sensitivity", "source_id": "Analisis CPM; Sensitivitas Harga", "defense": "Consumers face zero switching costs between supermarket and minimarket chains, actively hunting promotional discounts on cooking oil, sugar, and rice. Severe sensitivity of -4.0.", "defense_id": "Konsumen tidak memiliki biaya peralihan antar-gerai ritel dan sangat sensitif terhadap selisih harga minyak goreng dan beras, menciptakan tekanan elastisitas tinggi (-4,0)."}, "sp_3": {"title": "Competitive Pressure: Score -6.0 (33,500 Minimarket Saturation)", "title_id": "Tekanan Persaingan: Skor -6,0 (Kejenuhan 33.500 Minimarket)", "source": "Case Exhibit 4; Indomaret & Alfamart Filings", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 4; Data Alfamart & Indomaret", "defense": "Intense rivalry from 33,500+ Indomaret and Alfamart stores situated within walking distance of housing complexes severely eroded hypermarket trip necessity. Extreme threat of -6.0.", "defense_id": "Dominasi 33.500+ gerai Indomaret dan Alfamart di depan kompleks perumahan melenyapkan kebutuhan berbelanja ke hipermarket besar. Ancaman persaingan ekstrem (-6,0)."}, "sp_4": {"title": "Barriers to Entry / PSAK 73: Score -4.0 (Crushing Fixed Leases)", "title_id": "Beban Regulasi / PSAK 73: Skor -4,0 (Beban Bunga Sewa Mal)", "source": "AR2020 Financial Note 16 (PSAK 73)", "source_id": "Catatan Keuangan AR2020 16 (PSAK 73)", "defense": "Adoption of PSAK 73 capitalized long-term lease liabilities, adding Rp166.2B in non-cash lease financing costs and restricting operational flexibility in closing mall stores (score -4.0).", "defense_id": "Penerapan PSAK 73 mengkapitalisasi liabilitas sewa, menambah beban bunga pembiayaan sewa Rp166,2M dan membebani fleksibilitas penutupan toko mal merugi (skor -4,0)."}}, "alfamart": {"fp_0": {"title": "Current Ratio: Score 5.0 (Healthy Cash Liquidity)", "title_id": "Rasio Lancar: Skor 5,0 (Likuiditas Kas Sangat Sehat)", "source": "Alfamart AR2020 Balance Sheet", "source_id": "Neraca AR2020 Alfamart", "defense": "Maintains a balanced current ratio of 1.05x backed by massive operating cash flow of Rp4.1 trillion, eliminating short-term liquidity risks. Score 5.0.", "defense_id": "Mempertahankan rasio lancar seimbang 1,05x ditopang arus kas operasi kuat Rp4,1 triliun, menghapus risiko likuiditas jangka pendek. Skor 5,0."}, "fp_1": {"title": "Debt to Equity: Score 6.0 (Conservative Low Leverage)", "title_id": "Utang terhadap Ekuitas: Skor 6,0 (Leverage Konservatif)", "source": "Alfamart AR2020 Financial Ratios", "source_id": "Rasio Keuangan AR2020 Alfamart", "defense": "Conservative debt-to-equity ratio of 0.88x (net debt comfortably covered by EBITDA), providing strong balance sheet capacity for expansion. Score 6.0.", "defense_id": "Rasio utang terhadap ekuitas konservatif 0,88x (utang bersih ter-cover penuh oleh EBITDA), memberi ruang neraca leluasa untuk ekspansi gerai baru. Skor 6,0."}, "fp_2": {"title": "Net Income: Score 6.0 (Rp1.06T Profit Record)", "title_id": "Laba Bersih: Skor 6,0 (Rekor Laba Bersih Rp1,06 T)", "source": "Alfamart AR2020 Income Statement", "source_id": "Laba Rugi AR2020 Alfamart", "defense": "Delivered net profit of Rp1.06 trillion (+4.2% YoY growth during the pandemic), demonstrating exceptional business model durability and profitability (score 6.0).", "defense_id": "Membukukan rekor laba bersih Rp1,06 triliun (+4,2% YoY di tengah pandemi), membuktikan daya tahan model bisnis minimarket lingkungan yang sangat menguntungkan (skor 6,0)."}, "fp_3": {"title": "Revenue Growth: Score 6.0 (Rp75.8T Revenue Surge)", "title_id": "Pertumbuhan Pendapatan: Skor 6,0 (Lonjakan Pendapatan Rp75,8 T)", "source": "Alfamart AR2020 Financial Performance", "source_id": "Kinerja Keuangan AR2020 Alfamart", "defense": "Net revenue climbed +3.95% to Rp75.8 trillion as residential neighbourhood stores captured traffic diverted away from closed destination shopping malls. Score 6.0.", "defense_id": "Pendapatan tumbuh +3,95% mencapai Rp75,8 triliun karena gerai lingkungan menyerap limpahan belanja dari mal besar yang ditutup. Skor 6,0."}, "fp_4": {"title": "Inventory Turnover: Score 5.0 (23-Day Rapid Cycle)", "title_id": "Perputaran Persediaan: Skor 5,0 (Siklus Cepat 23 Hari)", "source": "Alfamart AR2020 Supply Chain Review", "source_id": "Tinjauan Logistik AR2020 Alfamart", "defense": "Highly streamlined 23.4-day inventory turnover powered by 32 regional distribution centers and real-time replenishment algorithms. Score 5.0.", "defense_id": "Perputaran persediaan sangat efisien hanya 23,4 hari didukung 32 pusat distribusi regional dan sistem restock otomatis terpadu. Skor 5,0."}, "cp_0": {"title": "Market Share: Score -1.0 (Dominant #1 Market Leader)", "title_id": "Pangsa Pasar: Skor -1,0 (Pemimpin Pasar #1 Dominan)", "source": "Case Exhibit 5; Industry Data", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 5; Data Industri", "defense": "Commands the leading retail footprint in Indonesia with 15,434 stores nationwide, generating unmatched distribution scale and top market share (-1.0 best score).", "defense_id": "Memimpin pasar ritel modern Indonesia dengan 15.434 gerai nasional, menguasai keunggulan skala terbesar (skor terbaik -1,0)."}, "cp_1": {"title": "Product Quality: Score -2.0 (High FMCG Consistency)", "title_id": "Mutu Produk: Skor -2,0 (Konsistensi Mutu FMCG Tinggi)", "source": "Alfamart Private Label Standards", "source_id": "Standar Private Label Alfamart", "defense": "Exemplary quality control on packaged FMCG and high-turnover private label goods, though fresh meat/produce assortment remains limited. Strong score -2.0.", "defense_id": "Kontrol kualitas sangat prima pada barang kemasan FMCG dan produk private label, meskipun lini produk daging segar terbatas. Skor kuat -2,0."}, "cp_2": {"title": "Customer Loyalty: Score -1.0 (Alfagift Digital Ecosystem)", "title_id": "Loyalitas Pelanggan: Skor -1,0 (Ekosistem Alfagift Unggul)", "source": "Alfamart AR2020 Digital Metrics", "source_id": "Metrik Digital AR2020 Alfamart", "defense": "Over 11 million active loyalty members on the Alfagift app offering personalized discounts, point redemptions, and instant local delivery (-1.0).", "defense_id": "Lebih dari 11 juta anggota aktif pada aplikasi Alfagift dengan diskon personal, poin belanja, dan pengantaran instan 30 menit (-1,0)."}, "cp_3": {"title": "Variety of Products: Score -2.0 (Curated 3,500 Essential SKUs)", "title_id": "Variasi Produk: Skor -2,0 (3.500 SKU Sembako Terpilih)", "source": "Alfamart Merchandising Planogram", "source_id": "Planogram Merchandising Alfamart", "defense": "Expertly curated 3,500 SKUs designed for rapid high-velocity convenience shopping, maximizing sales per shelf meter. Score -2.0.", "defense_id": "Menyajikan 3.500 SKU kebutuhan pokok harian yang terkurasi optimal untuk belanja cepat, memaksimalkan perputaran per meter rak (-2,0)."}, "cp_4": {"title": "Control over Suppliers: Score -1.0 (Immense Buying Power)", "title_id": "Kendali Pemasok: Skor -1,0 (Daya Tawar Pembelian Raksasa)", "source": "CPM Matrix; Vendor Terms Analysis", "source_id": "Matriks CPM; Analisis Ketentuan Vendor", "defense": "Vast nationwide purchase volume gives Alfamart top bargaining power over Unilever, Indofood, and P&G for listing fees and volume rebates (-1.0).", "defense_id": "Volume pembelian masif memberi Alfamart daya tawar terkuat atas produsen FMCG raksasa (Unilever, Indofood) untuk diskon volume dan listing fee (-1,0)."}, "ip_0": {"title": "Growth Potential: Score 6.0 (Proximity Format Expansion)", "title_id": "Potensi Pertumbuhan: Skor 6,0 (Ekspansi Format Dekat Rumah)", "source": "Retail Industry Outlook 2020", "source_id": "Prospek Industri Ritel 2020", "defense": "Residential proximity minimarkets represent over 80% of modern grocery expansion in Southeast Asia, providing stellar growth runway (score 6.0).", "defense_id": "Minimarket lingkungan menyumbang lebih dari 80% pembukaan toko modern di Asia Tenggara, membuka potensi pertumbuhan luar biasa (skor 6,0)."}, "ip_1": {"title": "Financial Stability: Score 5.0 (Essential Cash Inflows)", "title_id": "Stabilitas Finansial: Skor 5,0 (Arus Kas Harian Terjamin)", "source": "Alfamart Operating Cash Flows", "source_id": "Arus Kas Operasional Alfamart", "defense": "Daily retail cash purchases of consumer staples generate steady, non-cyclical cash inflows even through macroeconomic shocks (score 5.0).", "defense_id": "Penjualan tunai harian sembako menghasilkan arus kas masuk yang stabil dan tidak terpengaruh siklus krisis ekonomi (skor 5,0)."}, "ip_2": {"title": "Ease of Entry: Score 4.0 (Duopoly Distribution Moat)", "title_id": "Hambatan Masuk: Skor 4,0 (Benteng Distribusi Duopoli)", "source": "Case Exhibit 4; Retail Saturation", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 4; Kejenuhan Ritel", "defense": "The established duopoly of Alfamart and Indomaret locks up prime commercial street corners, making new retail entry extremely difficult (score 4.0).", "defense_id": "Duopoli mapan Alfamart dan Indomaret mengunci lokasi strategis di setiap sudut jalan, membuat pemain baru sangat sulit masuk (skor 4,0)."}, "ip_3": {"title": "Resource Utilization: Score 6.0 (Top Sales Density ~Rp35M/m\u00b2)", "title_id": "Pemanfaatan Ruang: Skor 6,0 (Densitas Penjualan ~Rp35M/m\u00b2)", "source": "Alfamart Store Productivity Filings", "source_id": "Keterbukaan Produktivitas Gerai Alfamart", "defense": "Compact 100\u2013120 m\u00b2 format delivers industry-leading sales density of ~Rp35 million per square meter, maximizing capital efficiency (score 6.0).", "defense_id": "Format kompak 100\u2013120 m\u00b2 menghasilkan produktivitas penjualan tertinggi di industri (~Rp35 juta/m\u00b2), memaksimalkan efisiensi ruang (skor 6,0)."}, "ip_4": {"title": "Profit Potential: Score 5.0 (High 15.8% ROE Generation)", "title_id": "Potensi Laba: Skor 5,0 (Tingkat ROE 15,8% Menguntungkan)", "source": "Alfamart Financial Ratios 2020", "source_id": "Rasio Keuangan Alfamart 2020", "defense": "Healthy operating margin (~2.8%) combined with rapid capital turns generates an attractive 15.8% Return on Equity (score 5.0).", "defense_id": "Margin operasi yang sehat (~2,8%) dikombinasikan dengan perputaran modal cepat menghasilkan ROE atraktif sebesar 15,8% (skor 5,0)."}, "sp_0": {"title": "Rate of Inflation: Score -2.0 (Resilient Staple Baskets)", "title_id": "Tingkat Inflasi: Skor -2,0 (Ketahanan Keranjang Pokok)", "source": "BPS Food Expenditure Survey", "source_id": "Survei Pengeluaran Pangan BPS", "defense": "Small-ticket daily grocery purchases are relatively immune to inflationary spikes as households continue purchasing rice, eggs, and milk. Mild impact of -2.0.", "defense_id": "Belanja harian bernilai kecil relatif kebal inflasi karena masyarakat tetap membeli telur, beras, dan susu. Dampak ringan (-2,0)."}, "sp_1": {"title": "Technological Changes: Score -2.0 (Integrated Alfagift Omnichannel)", "title_id": "Pergeseran Teknologi: Skor -2,0 (Integrasi Digital Alfagift)", "source": "Alfamart Omnichannel Capabilities", "source_id": "Kapabilitas Omnichannel Alfamart", "defense": "Alfamart successfully digitized store operations with Alfagift, transforming 15,000 stores into micro-fulfillment hubs for 30-minute deliveries (-2.0).", "defense_id": "Alfamart berhasil mendigitalisasi gerai fisik lewat Alfagift, menyulap 15.000 toko menjadi hub pengantaran 30 menit (-2,0)."}, "sp_2": {"title": "Price Elasticity: Score -3.0 (Convenience Premium Tolerance)", "title_id": "Elastisitas Harga: Skor -3,0 (Toleransi Premi Kenyamanan)", "source": "Consumer Pricing Elasticity Study", "source_id": "Studi Elastisitas Harga Konsumen", "defense": "Consumers willingly accept a 3\u20135% convenience premium at nearby minimarkets to save time and transport costs compared to hypermarket trips (-3.0).", "defense_id": "Konsumen rela membayar selisih harga 3-5% di minimarket dekat rumah demi menghemat waktu dan ongkos perjalanan ke mal (-3,0)."}, "sp_3": {"title": "Competitive Pressure: Score -3.0 (Stable Duopoly Equilibrium)", "title_id": "Tekanan Persaingan: Skor -3,0 (Keseimbangan Duopoli Stabil)", "source": "Case Exhibit 4; Minimarket Rivalry", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 4; Persaingan Minimarket", "defense": "While competition with Indomaret is constant, both players respect price discipline and avoid margin-destroying price wars, yielding score -3.0.", "defense_id": "Meski bersaing ketat dengan Indomaret, kedua pihak menjaga disiplin harga dan menghindari perang tarif yang merusak margin (-3,0)."}, "sp_4": {"title": "Barriers to Entry / Leases: Score -3.0 (Flexible Shophouse Leases)", "title_id": "Fleksibilitas Sewa: Skor -3,0 (Sewa Ruko Fleksibel)", "source": "Alfamart Lease Commitments", "source_id": "Komitmen Sewa Alfamart", "defense": "Store leases on small shophouses average 3\u20135 years, providing high flexibility to close or relocate underperforming locations with low PSAK 73 burden (-3.0).", "defense_id": "Sewa ruko hanya berdurasi 3-5 tahun, memberi fleksibilitas tinggi untuk menutup atau merelokasi gerai dengan beban PSAK 73 minimal (-3,0)."}}, "transmart": {"fp_0": {"title": "Current Ratio: Score 2.0 (Tight Working Capital)", "title_id": "Rasio Lancar: Skor 2,0 (Modal Kerja Tertekan)", "source": "CT Corp Retail Filings; Industry Audits", "source_id": "Laporan Ritel CT Corp; Audit Industri", "defense": "Constrained current ratio (~0.8x) due to high cash burn in large mall hypermarket complexes and idle amusement facilities. Low score 2.0.", "defense_id": "Rasio lancar tertekan (~0,8x) akibat besarnya beban kas operasional hipermarket mal besar dan wahana permainan yang sepi. Skor rendah 2,0."}, "fp_1": {"title": "Debt to Equity: Score 1.0 (Heavy Expansion Debt)", "title_id": "Utang terhadap Ekuitas: Skor 1,0 (Beban Utang Ekspansi Berat)", "source": "CT Corp Capital Structure Reports", "source_id": "Struktur Modal CT Corp", "defense": "Substantial debt burden accumulated during aggressive nationwide rollout of Trans Studio Mall entertainment hypermarket complexes. Minimum score 1.0.", "defense_id": "Beban utang sangat tinggi akibat ekspansi agresif pembangunan mal Trans Studio terintegrasi di berbagai kota. Skor minimum 1,0."}, "fp_2": {"title": "Net Income: Score 1.0 (Severe Operating Losses)", "title_id": "Laba Bersih: Skor 1,0 (Kerugian Operasional Parah)", "source": "Case Exhibit 5; Industry Disclosures", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 5; Laporan Industri", "defense": "Severe multi-year net losses exacerbated by complete shutdown of amusement park rides and cinema entertainment during lockdowns. Score 1.0.", "defense_id": "Kerugian bersih parah berturut-turut diperburuk penutupan wahana bermain dan bioskop selama pembatasan aktivitas. Skor 1,0."}, "fp_3": {"title": "Revenue Growth: Score 2.0 (Sales Contraction Post-Rebrand)", "title_id": "Pertumbuhan Pendapatan: Skor 2,0 (Penjualan Turun Pasca-Rebranding)", "source": "Case Exhibit 5; Carrefour Transition", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 5; Transisi Carrefour", "defense": "Steep revenue decline following rebranding from Carrefour to Transmart, with mall hypermarket footfall dropping sharply across major cities. Score 2.0.", "defense_id": "Penurunan pendapatan tajam pasca-rebranding dari Carrefour ke Transmart, diperparah anjloknya pengunjung hipermarket mal besar. Skor 2,0."}, "fp_4": {"title": "Inventory Turnover: Score 2.0 (Sluggish Non-Food Inventory)", "title_id": "Perputaran Persediaan: Skor 2,0 (Persediaan Non-Pangan Lambat)", "source": "Industry Merchandising Audits", "source_id": "Audit Merchandising Ritel", "defense": "High days-in-inventory (>60 days) caused by slow-moving department store apparel, electronics, and home furnishings tying up vital working capital (score 2.0).", "defense_id": "Hari persediaan tinggi (>60 hari) akibat menumpuknya stok pakaian, elektronik, dan perabotan yang lambat terjual, menyedot kas modal kerja (skor 2,0)."}, "cp_0": {"title": "Market Share: Score -5.0 (Eroding Modern Retail Share)", "title_id": "Pangsa Pasar: Skor -5,0 (Pangsa Ritel Terus Menyusut)", "source": "Case Exhibit 5; Retail Share Estimates", "source_id": "Kasus Lampiran 5; Estimasi Pangsa Ritel", "defense": "Sales of ~Rp13.8T across only 134 stores represent less than 5% market share, with customers rapidly defecting to minimarkets and supermarkets (score -5.0).", "defense_id": "Penjualan ~Rp13,8T dari 134 gerai hanya mencakup <5% pangsa ritel, dengan arus pelanggan terus berpindah ke minimarket dan supermarket (-5,0)."}, "cp_1": {"title": "Product Quality: Score -4.0 (Inconsistent Fresh Produce)", "title_id": "Mutu Produk: Skor -4,0 (Inkonsistensi Produk Segar)", "source": "Consumer Satisfaction Benchmarks", "source_id": "Tolok Ukur Kepuasan Konsumen", "defense": "Variable fresh food standards and inconsistent cold storage maintenance resulted in customer dissatisfaction and high spoilage rates. Score -4.0.", "defense_id": "Kualitas produk segar yang tidak konsisten dan perawatan pendingin gerai yang kurang merata memicu keluhan pembeli dan retur barang tinggi (-4,0)."}, "cp_2": {"title": "Customer Loyalty: Score -5.0 (Perceived Expensive & Footfall Loss)", "title_id": "Loyalitas Pelanggan: Skor -5,0 (Persepsi Mahal & Hilangnya Kunjungan)", "source": "Case p. 590; Brand Perception Surveys", "source_id": "Kasus hlm. 590; Survei Persepsi Merek", "defense": "Lost customer goodwill post-Carrefour due to perceived premium pricing without superior service, causing foot-traffic retention to plummet (score -5.0).", "defense_id": "Kehilangan loyalitas pelanggan pasca-Carrefour karena dipersepsikan lebih mahal tanpa peningkatan layanan, menyebabkan retensi belanja anjlok (-5,0)."}, "cp_3": {"title": "Variety of Products: Score -5.0 (Assortment Gaps & Stockouts)", "title_id": "Variasi Produk: Skor -5,0 (Kekosongan Rak & Pasokan Tersendat)", "source": "Store Shelf Audits 2020", "source_id": "Audit Ketersediaan Rak 2020", "defense": "While floor space is massive, severe working capital constraints led to empty shelves and out-of-stock basic consumer goods (-5.0).", "defense_id": "Meskipun toko sangat luas, kendala likuiditas menyebabkan rak sembako banyak yang kosong dan kehabisan stok barang primer (-5,0)."}, "cp_4": {"title": "Control over Suppliers: Score -5.0 (Strained Supplier Terms)", "title_id": "Kendali Pemasok: Skor -5,0 (Hubungan Pemasok Sangat Tegang)", "source": "FMCG Supplier Association Reports", "source_id": "Laporan Asosiasi Pemasok FMCG", "defense": "Extended payment delays caused several major food manufacturers and distributors to withhold inventory shipments, weakening supplier control to -5.0.", "defense_id": "Penundaan pembayaran utang dagang yang lama membuat distributor FMCG utama menahan pengiriman barang, merusak posisi tawar ke -5,0."}, "ip_0": {"title": "Growth Potential: Score 3.0 (Secular Big-Box Contraction)", "title_id": "Potensi Pertumbuhan: Skor 3,0 (Kontraksi Format Mal Hipermarket)", "source": "Retail Format Growth Analysis", "source_id": "Analisis Pertumbuhan Format Ritel", "defense": "Large destination hypermarkets and mall-entertainment retail models face structural secular decline as shoppers favor convenient neighbourhood stores (score 3.0).", "defense_id": "Hipermarket mal dan konsep mall-entertainment men