    "label": "Slide 18: Five main competitors",
    "short": "Five competitors",
    "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Competitive assessment · Consumer grocery retail · 2020</div>\n<h2>Five main competitors</h2>\n<p class=\"competitor-intro-scope\">Head-to-head scope: MPPA’s grocery business, anchored in Hypermart (Case Exhibit 8).</p>\n<div class=\"market-two-col\">\n  <div class=\"market-visual-panel\">\n    <h3>EXHIBIT 8 · Sales of Top 5 Food Retailers (2020)</h3>\n    <p class=\"sub\">In millions of USD · Source: Euromonitor, 2020 (Case 23, p. 593)</p>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 250\" class=\"exhibit8-chart\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Exhibit 8: Sales of Top 5 Food Retailers in Indonesia in 2020 in millions of USD\">\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">7,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">6,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">5,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">4,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"131\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">3,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"157\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">2,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"184\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"184\" stroke=\"#e9dfe5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">1,000</text>\n      <line x1=\"45\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#30252b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#73616c\">0</text>\n      <!-- Indomaret: 5,900 -->\n      <rect x=\"58\" y=\"54\" width=\"48\" height=\"156\" fill=\"#b6002d\" rx=\"2\"/>\n      <text x=\"82\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">5,900</text>\n      <text x=\"82\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">Indomaret</text>\n      <text x=\"82\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#73616c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Salim)</text>\n      <!-- Alfamart: 5,256 -->\n      <rect x=\"136\" y=\"71\" width=\"48\" height=\"139\" fill=\"#b6002d\" rx=\"2\"/>\n      <text x=\"160\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">5,256</text>\n      <text x=\"160\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">Alfamart</text>\n      <text x=\"160\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#73616c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Sumber Alf.)</text>\n      <!-- Transmart: 954 -->\n      <rect x=\"214\" y=\"185\" width=\"48\" height=\"25\" fill=\"#786681\" rx=\"2\"/>\n      <text x=\"238\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">954</text>\n      <text x=\"238\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">Transmart</text>\n      <text x=\"238\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#73616c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Trans Retail)</text>\n      <!-- Alfa Midi: 863 -->\n      <rect x=\"292\" y=\"187\" width=\"48\" height=\"23\" fill=\"#786681\" rx=\"2\"/>\n      <text x=\"316\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">863</text>\n      <text x=\"316\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#30252b\">Alfa Midi</text>\n      <text x=\"316\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#73616c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(Sumber Alf.)</text>\n      <!-- Hypermart: 414 -->\n      <rect x=\"370\" y=\"199\" width=\"48\" height=\"11\" fill=\"#df0036\" rx=\"2\"/>\n      <text x=\"394\" y=\"191\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#df0036\">414</text>\n      <text x=\"394\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#df0036\">Hypermart</text>\n      <text x=\"394\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#df0036\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(MPPA)</text>\n    </svg>\n    <div class=\"exhibit7-callout\">\n      <span>Top 2 Combined: <strong>$11,156M (72.6%)</strong></span>\n      <span>Hypermart Share: <strong>2.7% ($414M)</strong></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"market-facts-panel\">\n    <div class=\"competitor-intro-head\"><span></span><span>Competitor</span><span>Retail format</span><span>Scope</span></div>\n    <div class=\"competitor-intro-list\">\n      <div class=\"competitor-intro-row\"><span class=\"competitor-intro-number\">01</span><strong>Indomaret</strong><span>Minimarket chain</span><span>Everyday grocery</span></div>\n      <div class=\"competitor-intro-row\"><span class=\"competitor-intro-number\">02</span><strong>Alfamart</strong><span>Minimarket chain</span><span>Everyday grocery</span></div>\n      <div class=\"competitor-intro-row\"><span class=\"competitor-intro-number\">03</span><strong>Transmart</strong><span>Hypermarket chain</span><span>Broad household</span></div>\n      <div class=\"competitor-intro-row\"><span class=\"competitor-intro-number\">04</span><strong>Alfamidi</strong><span>Fresh supermarket</span><span>Daily fresh &amp; packaged groceries</span></div>\n      <div class=\"competitor-intro-row\"><span class=\"competitor-intro-number\">05</span><strong>LotteMart</strong><span>Hyper / wholesale</span><span>Broad household</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: case Exhibit 8, printed p. 593; Indoritel &amp; Alfamidi AR2020; Lotte Shopping disclosures</span><span>18 / 30</span></div>"
