    "label": "Slide 19: Competitive Profile Matrix (CPM)",
    "short": "CPM Matrix",
    "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy formulation · Stage 1 · Input</div>\n<h2>Competitive Profile Matrix (CPM)</h2>\n<div class=\"cpm-inspector\" id=\"cpm-ins-box\">\n  <div class=\"cpm-ins-head\">\n    <span class=\"cpm-ins-pill cpm-pill-mppa\" id=\"cpm-ins-pill\">MPPA (Hypermart)</span>\n    <span class=\"cpm-ins-title\" id=\"cpm-ins-title\">Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity · W: 0.16 · Rating 2 (Minor Weakness) · Score: 0.32</span>\n    <div class=\"brand-pill-wrap\" id=\"cpm-ins-logos\"><span class=\"brand-pill pill-hypermart\">Hypermart</span></div>\n    <span class=\"cpm-ins-source\" id=\"cpm-ins-source\">AR2020 pp. 2, 46</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cpm-ins-body\" id=\"cpm-ins-body\">\n    <strong>Evidence &amp; Rationale:</strong> 211 stores (100 Hypermarts); large mall stores suffered steep traffic drops during COVID curbs.\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cpm-table-wrap\">\n  <table class=\"cpm-matrix-table\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th rowspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-factor\">Critical Success Factor</th>\n        <th rowspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-weight\">Weight</th>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-company cpm-th-mppa\">MPPA</th>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-company\">Indomaret</th>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-company\">Alfamart</th>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-company\">Transmart</th>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-company\">Alfamidi</th>\n        <th colspan=\"2\" class=\"cpm-th-company\">LotteMart</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub cpm-th-mppa\">R</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub cpm-th-mppa\">S</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">R</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">S</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">R</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">S</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">R</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">S</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">R</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">S</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">R</th>\n        <th class=\"cpm-th-sub\">S</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Industry Benchmark\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-industry\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"—\" data-rating-label=\"\" data-score=\"—\" data-evidence=\"Critical Success Factor: Evaluates competitive differentiation across all six tracked modern food retailers.\" data-source=\"Weight: 0.16\" data-weight-reason=\"Store proximity gets the highest weight because it shapes where shoppers make frequent, routine purchases.\">Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-weight\">0.16</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-td-mppa cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"MPPA (Hypermart)\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-mppa\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.32\" data-evidence=\"211 stores (100 Hypermarts); large mall stores suffered steep traffic drops during COVID curbs.\" data-source=\"AR2020 pp. 2, 46\">2</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-td-mppa cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"MPPA (Hypermart)\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-mppa\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.32\" data-evidence=\"211 stores (100 Hypermarts); large mall stores suffered steep traffic drops during COVID curbs.\" data-source=\"AR2020 pp. 2, 46\">0.32</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Indomaret\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-indomaret\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.64\" data-evidence=\"18,113 stores; 42% outlet share; located right inside residential neighborhoods.\" data-source=\"Indoritel AR2020 p. 24\">4</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Indomaret\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-indomaret\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.64\" data-evidence=\"18,113 stores; 42% outlet share; located right inside residential neighborhoods.\" data-source=\"Indoritel AR2020 p. 24\">0.64</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamart\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.64\" data-evidence=\"15,438 stores; 52% outlet share; dense neighborhood presence across Indonesia.\" data-source=\"AMRT AR2020\">4</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamart\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.64\" data-evidence=\"15,438 stores; 52% outlet share; dense neighborhood presence across Indonesia.\" data-source=\"AMRT AR2020\">0.64</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Transmart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-transmart\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.32\" data-evidence=\"~134 supercenters; destination mall stores heavily affected by lockdowns.\" data-source=\"Case Exhibit 8\">2</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Transmart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-transmart\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.32\" data-evidence=\"~134 supercenters; destination mall stores heavily affected by lockdowns.\" data-source=\"Case Exhibit 8\">0.32</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamidi\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamidi\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.48\" data-evidence=\"1,821 stores (+266 new in 2020); convenient mid-sized residential supermarkets.\" data-source=\"AR2020 MIDI p. 2\">3</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamidi\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamidi\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.48\" data-evidence=\"1,821 stores (+266 new in 2020); convenient mid-sized residential supermarkets.\" data-source=\"AR2020 MIDI p. 2\">0.48</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"LotteMart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-lottemart\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"1\" data-rating-label=\"Major Weakness\" data-score=\"0.16\" data-evidence=\"~50 stores (~15 retail, ~35 wholesale); destination centers with lower local access.\" data-source=\"Lotte Shopping Note 1(3)\">1</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"LotteMart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-lottemart\" data-factor=\"Store Accessibility &amp; Proximity\" data-weight=\"0.16\" data-rating=\"1\" data-rating-label=\"Major Weakness\" data-score=\"0.16\" data-evidence=\"~50 stores (~15 retail, ~35 wholesale); destination centers with lower local access.\" data-source=\"Lotte Shopping Note 1(3)\">0.16</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Industry Benchmark\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-industry\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"—\" data-rating-label=\"\" data-score=\"—\" data-evidence=\"Critical Success Factor: Evaluates competitive differentiation across all six tracked modern food retailers.\" data-source=\"Weight: 0.14\" data-weight-reason=\"Price gets a high weight because grocery shoppers can easily switch stores and purchasing scale helps retailers keep prices low.\">Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-weight\">0.14</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-td-mppa cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"MPPA (Hypermart)\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-mppa\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.28\" data-evidence=\"Rp6.75T sales; 19.4% gross margin; active price-matching promotions.\" data-source=\"AR2020 pp. 12, 38\">2</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-td-mppa cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"MPPA (Hypermart)\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-mppa\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.28\" data-evidence=\"Rp6.75T sales; 19.4% gross margin; active price-matching promotions.\" data-source=\"AR2020 pp. 12, 38\">0.28</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Indomaret\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-indomaret\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.56\" data-evidence=\"~$5,900M (~Rp85.7T); massive purchasing volume gives unmatched supplier discounts.\" data-source=\"Case Exhibit 8\">4</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Indomaret\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-indomaret\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.56\" data-evidence=\"~$5,900M (~Rp85.7T); massive purchasing volume gives unmatched supplier discounts.\" data-source=\"Case Exhibit 8\">0.56</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamart\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.56\" data-evidence=\"Rp75.83T sales; 20.7% gross margin; top-tier packaged goods supplier rebates.\" data-source=\"AMRT AR2020\">4</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamart\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Major Strength\" data-score=\"0.56\" data-evidence=\"Rp75.83T sales; 20.7% gross margin; top-tier packaged goods supplier rebates.\" data-source=\"AMRT AR2020\">0.56</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Transmart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-transmart\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.28\" data-evidence=\"~$954M (~Rp13.86T); relies heavily on Bank Mega 10% card discounts.\" data-source=\"Case Exhibit 8\">2</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Transmart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-transmart\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"2\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Weakness\" data-score=\"0.28\" data-evidence=\"~$954M (~Rp13.86T); relies heavily on Bank Mega 10% card discounts.\" data-source=\"Case Exhibit 8\">0.28</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamidi\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamidi\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.42\" data-evidence=\"Rp12.66T sales; 24.1% margin; shares supplier deals with parent Alfamart.\" data-source=\"MIDI AR2020 p. 76\">3</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Alfamidi\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-alfamidi\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.42\" data-evidence=\"Rp12.66T sales; 24.1% margin; shares supplier deals with parent Alfamart.\" data-source=\"MIDI AR2020 p. 76\">0.42</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"LotteMart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-lottemart\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.42\" data-evidence=\"~Rp2.47T retail; strong bulk wholesale buying power.\" data-source=\"Lotte Shopping FS\">3</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"LotteMart\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-lottemart\" data-factor=\"Price Competitiveness &amp; Purchasing Scale\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.42\" data-evidence=\"~Rp2.47T retail; strong bulk wholesale buying power.\" data-source=\"Lotte Shopping FS\">0.42</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Industry Benchmark\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-industry\" data-factor=\"Assortment Breadth &amp; Fresh Food Offer\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"—\" data-rating-label=\"\" data-score=\"—\" data-evidence=\"Critical Success Factor: Evaluates competitive differentiation across all six tracked modern food retailers.\" data-source=\"Weight: 0.14\" data-weight-reason=\"We weighted assortment at 0.14, alongside price, because fresh food and a broad selection give shoppers a reason to choose a store and return.\">Assortment Breadth &amp; Fresh Food Offer</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-weight\">0.14</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-td-mppa cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"MPPA (Hypermart)\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-mppa\" data-factor=\"Assortment Breadth &amp; Fresh Food Offer\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.42\" data-rationale=\"We gave MPPA a 3 (Minor Strength) because its 30,000+ items and fresh-food offer were broader than those of Indomaret and Alfamart, which mostly sold packaged goods. Fresh food also grew to 27.7% of MPPA sales in 2020. | But Transmart and LotteMart carried more items, and Alfamidi had dedicated produce and meat sections. We scored all four fresh-food competitors a 3.\" data-evidence=\"27.7% of sales from fresh food (up from 24%); 30k+ items; strong fresh food advantage.\" data-source=\"AR2020 p. 38\">3</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-score cpm-td-mppa cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"MPPA (Hypermart)\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-mppa\" data-factor=\"Assortment Breadth &amp; Fresh Food Offer\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"3\" data-rating-label=\"Minor Strength\" data-score=\"0.42\" data-rationale=\"We gave MPPA a 3 (Minor Strength) because its 30,000+ items and fresh-food offer were broader than those of Indomaret and Alfamart, which mostly sold packaged goods. Fresh food also grew to 27.7% of MPPA sales in 2020. | But Transmart and LotteMart carried more items, and Alfamidi had dedicated produce and meat sections. We scored all four fresh-food competitors a 3.\" data-evidence=\"27.7% of sales from fresh food (up from 24%); 30k+ items; strong fresh food advantage.\" data-source=\"AR2020 p. 38\">0.42</td>\n        <td class=\"cpm-td-rating cpm-hoverable\" data-company=\"Indomaret\" data-company-class=\"cpm-pill-indomaret\" data-factor=\"Assortment Breadth &amp; Fresh Food Offer\" data-weight=\"0.14\" data-rating=\"1\" data-rating-label=\"Major Weakness\" data-score=\"0.14\" data-evidence=\"Mainly packaged goods (~4k items); snacks and drinks; very little fresh food.\" data-source=\"Indoritel AR2020\">1</td>\