    "label": "Slide 20: External Factor Evaluation (EFE Matrix)",
    "short": "EFE Matrix",
    "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy formulation · Stage 1 · Input</div>\n<h2>External Factor Evaluation (EFE Matrix)</h2>\n<div class=\"efe-inspector\" id=\"efe-ins-box\">\n  <div class=\"efe-ins-head\">\n    <span class=\"efe-ins-pill efe-pill-opp\" id=\"efe-ins-pill\">Opportunity O1</span>\n    <span class=\"efe-ins-title\" id=\"efe-ins-title\">E-Commerce Grocery Expansion · Rating 4 (Superior) · W: 0.07 (WS: 0.28)</span>\n    <span class=\"efe-ins-source\" id=\"efe-ins-source\">Google-Temasek-Bain 2020 · Slide 10</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"efe-ins-body\" id=\"efe-ins-body\">\n    <strong>Analytical Rationale:</strong> MPPA responded superiorly (Rating 4) by deploying Hypermart Online in 103 stores, WhatsApp Chat &amp; Shop in 125 stores, and GrabMart in 97 stores. Perishable cold-chain shields fresh food from ambient delivery marketplaces.\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"efe-matrix-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"efe-column\">\n    <div class=\"efe-col-head\">\n      <span class=\"efe-col-title\">10 Opportunities</span>\n      <span class=\"efe-col-badge\">Subtotal: 0.50 | 1.67</span>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"efe-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"th-factor\">Critical External Factor</th>\n          <th class=\"th-num\">W</th>\n          <th class=\"th-num\">R</th>\n          <th class=\"th-num\">WS</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"efe-row efe-row-top\" data-code=\"O1\" data-type=\"Opportunity\" data-name=\"Rapid Online Grocery Market Growth\" data-rating=\"4\" data-rating-label=\"Superior\" data-weight=\"0.07\" data-ws=\"0.28\" data-source=\"Google-Temasek-Bain 2020 · Slide 10\" data-rationale=\"MPPA responded superiorly (Rating 4) by deploying Hypermart Online in 103 stores, WhatsApp Chat & Shop in 125 stores, and GrabMart in 97 stores.\" data-hover-reason=\"MPPA made online ordering widely available through Hypermart Online, WhatsApp and GrabMart, reaching 103, 125 and 97 stores r