sale -->\n          <tr class=\"bcg-row\" data-division=\"smartclub\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/smartclub-logo.png\" alt=\"SmartClub\" class=\"bcg-brand-logo\"><div><strong>SmartClub Wholesale</strong><small>1 store · B2B Cash &amp; Carry</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-rev\">\n              <span class=\"bcg-rev-val\">Rp134 B</span>\n              <span class=\"bcg-share-pill share-b2b\">2.0% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-riv\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-rival-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/lottemart-logo.svg\" alt=\"Lotte Wholesale\" class=\"bcg-rival-logo\">\n                <div class=\"bcg-rival-info\">\n                  <span class=\"bcg-rival-name\">Lotte Wholesale (Lotte)</span>\n                  <span class=\"bcg-rival-rev\">Rp7,800 B</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-met\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-metrics-cell\">\n                <span class=\"bcg-metric-rmsp\">0.01 <small>RMSP</small></span>\n                <span class=\"bcg-growth-chip growth-neg\">▼ -15.0% IGR</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-quad\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-quad-cell\">\n                <span class=\"bcg-quad-chip chip-dog\">DOG</span>\n                <span class=\"bcg-strat-desc\">Divestiture or Liquidation</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 6: FMX Convenience Store -->\n          <tr class=\"bcg-row\" data-division=\"fmx\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/fmx-logo.png\" alt=\"FMX\" class=\"bcg-brand-logo\">\n                <div><strong>FMX (Foodmart Xpress)</strong><small>14 stores · Convenience Store</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-rev\">\n              <span class=\"bcg-rev-val\">Rp46 B</span>\n              <span class=\"bcg-share-pill share-kiosk\" style=\"background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;\">0.7% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-riv\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-rival-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/indomaret-logo.png\" alt=\"Indomaret\" class=\"bcg-rival-logo\">\n                <div class=\"bcg-rival-info\">\n                  <span class=\"bcg-rival-name\">Indomaret (Salim Group)</span>\n                  <span class=\"bcg-rival-rev\">Rp80,000 B</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-met\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-metrics-cell\">\n                <span class=\"bcg-metric-rmsp\">0.001 <small>RMSP</small></span>\n                <span class=\"bcg-growth-chip growth-neg\">▼ -8.0% IGR</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"bcg-td-quad\">\n              <div class=\"bcg-quad-cell\">\n                <span class=\"bcg-quad-chip chip-dog\">DOG</span>\n                <span class=\"bcg-strat-desc\">Pruning &amp; Transit Pilot</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"bcg-calculation\" class=\"bcg-calculation\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span class=\"bcg-calc-idle\">ℹ️ Hover over any division row or chart bubble to see exact RMSP &amp; IGR calculations.</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"bcg-summary-card\">\n      <div class=\"bcg-summary-head\">\n        <strong>Portfolio implications using Fred David’s framework:</strong>\n        <span>Rebalance Capital from Dogs to High-Growth Question Marks</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bcg-summary-grid\">\n        <div class=\"bcg-sum-col sum-col-harvest\">\n          <b class=\"sum-harvest-txt\">1. Harvest Hypermart (84.5%)</b>\n          <p>Downsize 6,000 m² hypermarkets into 2,500 m² compact formats; sublease or convert excess space to MPPA hybrid O2O storefronts.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bcg-sum-col sum-col-invest\">\n          <b class=\"sum-invest-txt\">2. Scale Question Marks (2.7%)</b>\n          <p>Channel cash flow into expanding Hyfresh (+10% IGR) and Boston HBC (+14% IGR) via standalone neighborhood locations.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bcg-sum-col sum-col-divest\">\n          <b class=\"sum-divest-txt\">3. Divest SmartClub (2.0%)</b>\n          <p>Liquidate or repurpose the single wholesale store to eliminate logistics fragmentation and recurring working capital drain.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Case 23 Exhibit 6; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet &#39;BCG&#39;</span><span>24 / 30</span></div>"
  },
  {
    "label": "Slide 25: Internal-External (IE) Matrix",
    "short": "IE Matrix",
    "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy formulation · The matching stage (IE Matrix)</div>\n<h2>Internal-External (IE) Matrix</h2>\n<div class=\"ie-inspector\" id=\"ie-ins-box\">\n  <div class=\"ie-ins-head\">\n    <span class=\"ie-ins-pill ie-pill-hold\" id=\"ie-ins-pill\">CELL V · HOLD AND MAINTAIN (CORPORATE)</span>\n    <span class=\"ie-ins-title\" id=\"ie-ins-title\">Corporate MPPA Resides in Cell V with Severe Divisional Polarization</span>\n    <span class=\"ie-ins-source\" id=\"ie-ins-source\">Case 23 pp. 588–596; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'IE'</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ie-ins-body\" id=\"ie-ins-body\">\n    <strong>Rationale:</strong> At the consolidated corporate level, MPPA's weighted IFE (2.21) and EFE (2.46) place the company in Cell V (Hold and Maintain). However, divisional portfolio reality is sharply polarized: 84.5% of revenues (Hypermart) border Cell VIII (Harvest or Divest) due to large-format mall exposure and chronic net cash drain, while high-growth compact formats (Hyfresh and Boston HBC, 2.7% of revenues) thrive in Cell II (Grow and Build). Our recommendation: Rightsizing hypermarkets to self-fund the aggressive rollout of compact neighborhood formats.\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ie-layout\">\n  <div class=\"ie-chart-panel\">\n    <div class=\"ie-panel-head\">\n      <div class=\"ie-panel-title-group\">\n        <span>9-Cell Internal-External Matrix (2020)</span>\n        <span class=\"ie-chart-sub\">IFE (4.0 Strong ← 1.0 Weak) · EFE (4.0 High → 1.0 Low) · Bubble = Sales Share</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <svg viewBox=\"-28 0 628 510\" class=\"ie-svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fred David Internal-External Matrix\">\n      <defs>\n        <filter id=\"ie-shadow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n          <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"3\" flood-opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n        </filter>\n      </defs>\n\n      <!-- 9 CELLS BACKGROUND GRID -->\n      <!-- Row 1: High EFE (3.0 to 4.0) -->\n      <!-- Cell I: Strong IFE (3.0 to 4.0) -> Grow & Build -->\n      <rect x=\"35\" y=\"35\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#f2faf5\" stroke=\"#bbf0cd\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"45\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#00875a\">I</text>\n      <text x=\"120\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#00875a\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">GROW &amp; BUILD</text>\n\n      <!-- Cell II: Average IFE (2.0 to 2.99) -> Grow & Build -->\n      <rect x=\"205\" y=\"35\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#f2faf5\" stroke=\"#bbf0cd\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"215\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#00875a\">II</text>\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#00875a\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">GROW &amp; BUILD</text>\n\n      <!-- Cell III: Weak IFE (1.0 to 1.99) -> Hold & Maintain -->\n      <rect x=\"375\" y=\"35\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#f2f7fd\" stroke=\"#cbe0fc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"385\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0055b8\">III</text>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0055b8\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">HOLD &amp; MAINTAIN</text>\n\n      <!-- Row 2: Medium EFE (2.0 to 2.99) -->\n      <!-- Cell IV: Strong IFE (3.0 to 4.0) -> Grow & Build -->\n      <rect x=\"35\" y=\"175\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#f2faf5\" stroke=\"#bbf0cd\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"45\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#00875a\">IV</text>\n      <text x=\"120\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#00875a\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">GROW &amp; BUILD</text>\n\n      <!-- Cell V: Average IFE (2.0 to 2.99) -> Hold & Maintain -->\n      <rect x=\"205\" y=\"175\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#f2f7fd\" stroke=\"#cbe0fc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"215\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0055b8\">V</text>\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0055b8\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">HOLD &amp; MAINTAIN</text>\n\n      <!-- Cell VI: Weak IFE (1.0 to 1.99) -> Harvest or Divest -->\n      <rect x=\"375\" y=\"175\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#fdf4f5\" stroke=\"#fed6db\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"385\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#df0036\">VI</text>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#df0036\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">HARVEST / DIVEST</text>\n\n      <!-- Row 3: Low EFE (1.0 to 1.99) -->\n      <!-- Cell VII: Strong IFE (3.0 to 4.0) -> Hold & Maintain -->\n      <rect x=\"35\" y=\"315\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#f2f7fd\" stroke=\"#cbe0fc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"45\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0055b8\">VII</text>\n      <text x=\"120\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0055b8\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">HOLD &amp; MAINTAIN</text>\n\n      <!-- Cell VIII: Average IFE (2.0 to 2.99) -> Harvest or Divest -->\n      <rect x=\"205\" y=\"315\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#fdf4f5\" stroke=\"#fed6db\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"215\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#df0036\">VIII</text>\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#df0036\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">HARVEST / DIVEST</text>\n\n      <!-- Cell IX: Weak IFE (1.0 to 1.99) -> Harvest or Divest -->\n      <rect x=\"375\" y=\"315\" width=\"170\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#fdf4f5\" stroke=\"#fed6db\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"3\" />\n      <text x=\"385\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"14px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#df0036\">IX</text>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#df0036\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">HARVEST / DIVEST</text>\n\n      <!-- BORDERS & AXIS TICKS -->\n      <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#73616c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"315\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"#73616c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"205\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"205\" y2=\"455\" stroke=\"#73616c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n      <line x1=\"375\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"375\" y2=\"455\" stroke=\"#73616c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n\n      <!-- Matrix Outer Border -->\n      <rect x=\"35\" y=\"35\" width=\"510\" height=\"420\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e181c\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"4\"/>\n\n      <!-- X-AXIS LABELS (TOP & BOTTOM) -->\n      <text x=\"35\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">4.0</text>\n      <text x=\"205\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">3.0</text>\n      <text x=\"375\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">2.0</text>\n      <text x=\"545\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">1.0</text>\n\n      <text x=\"120\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#00875a\">STRONG (3.0 – 4.0)</text>\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0055b8\">AVERAGE (2.0 – 2.99)</text>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#df0036\">WEAK (1.0 – 1.99)</text>\n\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#1e181c\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\">THE IFE TOTAL WEIGHTED SCORES</text>\n\n      <!-- Y-AXIS LABELS (LEFT) -->\n      <text x=\"25\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">4.0</text>\n      <text x=\"25\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">3.0</text>\n      <text x=\"25\" y=\"319\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">2.0</text>\n      <text x=\"25\" y=\"459\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#1e181c\">1.0</text>\n\n      <text x=\"15\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#00875a\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 105)\">HIGH (3.0–4.0)</text>\n      <text x=\"15\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0055b8\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 245)\">MEDIUM (2.0–2.99)</text>\n      <text x=\"15\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#df0036\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 385)\">LOW (1.0–1.99)</text>\n\n      <text x=\"-14\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#1e181c\" letter-spacing=\"0.5px\" transform=\"rotate(-90 -14 245)\">THE EFE TOTAL WEIGHTED SCORES</text>\n\n      <!-- DIVISION BUBBLES -->\n      <!-- 1. Hyfresh: IFE 2.85, EFE 3.10 -> cx=231, cy=161, r=14 (Grow & Build, Cell II) -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('hyfresh')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('hyfresh')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <circle cx=\"231\" cy=\"161\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#00875a\" fill-opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"ie-bubble-circle\" filter=\"url(#ie-shadow)\"/>\n        <line x1=\"231\" y1=\"147\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#00875a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" class=\"ie-leader-line\"/>\n        <rect x=\"90\" y=\"95\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#00875a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"142\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#00875a\">Hyfresh (2.0%)</text>\n        <text x=\"142\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#29272b\">IFE 2.85 · EFE 3.10</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 2. Boston HBC: IFE 2.75, EFE 3.15 -> cx=248, cy=154, r=15 (Grow & Build, Cell II) -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"boston\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('boston')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('boston')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"154\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#059669\" fill-opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"ie-bubble-circle\" filter=\"url(#ie-shadow)\"/>\n        <line x1=\"248\" y1=\"139\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" class=\"ie-leader-line\"/>\n        <rect x=\"300\" y=\"95\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"355\" y=\"107\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#059669\">Boston HBC (0.7%)</text>\n        <text x=\"355\" y=\"118\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#29272b\">IFE 2.75 · EFE 3.15</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 3. Foodmart & Primo: IFE 2.38, EFE 2.52 -> cx=308, cy=242, r=21 (Hold & Maintain, Cell V) -->\n      <!-- Callout badge shifted to Cell IV to clear Cell V -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"foodmart\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('foodmart')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('foodmart')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"242\" r=\"19\" fill=\"#0055b8\" fill-opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"ie-bubble-circle\" filter=\"url(#ie-shadow)\"/>\n        <line x1=\"287\" y1=\"242\" x2=\"201\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#0055b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" class=\"ie-leader-line\"/>\n        <rect x=\"75\" y=\"228\" width=\"126\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0055b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"138\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0055b8\">Foodmart &amp; Primo (10.2%)</text>\n        <text x=\"138\" y=\"251\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#29272b\">IFE 2.38 · EFE 2.52</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 4. SmartClub Wholesale: IFE 1.65, EFE 1.60 -> cx=435, cy=371, r=10 (Harvest / Divest, Cell IX) -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"smartclub\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('smartclub')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('smartclub')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <circle cx=\"435\" cy=\"371\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"ie-bubble-circle\" filter=\"url(#ie-shadow)\"/>\n        <line x1=\"435\" y1=\"381\" x2=\"455\" y2=\"415\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" class=\"ie-leader-line\"/>\n        <rect x=\"405\" y=\"415\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"465\" y=\"427\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\">SmartClub (2.0%)</text>\n        <text x=\"465\" y=\"438\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#29272b\">IFE 1.65 · EFE 1.60 (Cell IX)</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 5. Hypermart: IFE 2.16, EFE 2.42 -> cx=365, cy=280, r=46 (Hold & Maintain / Harvest border, Cell V) -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"hypermart\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('hypermart')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('hypermart')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"280\" r=\"46\" fill=\"#df0036\" fill-opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" class=\"ie-bubble-circle\" filter=\"url(#ie-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"365\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.5px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Hypermart</text>\n        <text x=\"365\" y=\"279\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Rp5,698 B (84.5%)</text>\n        <text x=\"365\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffe6eb\">IFE 2.16 · EFE 2.42</text>\n        <text x=\"365\" y=\"303\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8px\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#ffffff\">CELL V / VIII DRAG</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 6. MPPA CONSOLIDATED CORPORATE MARKER: IFE 2.21, EFE 2.46 -> cx=339, cy=246 -->\n      <!-- Placed down-left in Cell V (x=182..300, y=272..298) -> COMPLETELY CLEARS \"V HOLD & MAINTAIN\" (y=195) -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"corporate\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('corporate')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('corporate')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <!-- Coordinate Halo at true coordinate (339, 246) -->\n        <circle cx=\"339\" cy=\"246\" r=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.85\"/>\n        <!-- Gold Diamond Marker at (339, 246) -->\n        <polygon points=\"339,239 346,246 339,253 332,246\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" stroke=\"#1e181c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"339\" cy=\"246\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#1e181c\"/>\n        \n        <!-- Dashed Leader Line down-left to badge -->\n        <line x1=\"332\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n        \n        <!-- Corporate Badge positioned in open space (y=272), 77px below \"V HOLD & MAINTAIN\" -->\n        <rect x=\"182\" y=\"272\" width=\"118\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#1e181c\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"241\" y=\"283\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.8px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#f59e0b\">★ MPPA CORP (Cell V)</text>\n        <text x=\"241\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fef3c7\">IFE 2.21 · EFE 2.46</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 7. FMX Convenience: IFE 1.80, EFE 1.85 -> cx=409, cy=336, r=7 (Cell IX Harvest / Divest) -->\n      <g class=\"ie-bubble-group\" data-division=\"fmx\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('fmx')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('fmx')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <circle cx=\"409\" cy=\"336\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#64748b\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"ie-bubble-circle\" filter=\"url(#ie-shadow)\"/>\n        <line x1=\"416\" y1=\"336\" x2=\"445\" y2=\"336\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" class=\"ie-leader-line\"/>\n        <rect x=\"445\" y=\"323\" width=\"92\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"/>\n        <text x=\"491\" y=\"334\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.8px\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#64748b\">FMX (0.7%)</text>\n        <text x=\"491\" y=\"344\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"7.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#29272b\">IFE 1.80 · EFE 1.85</text>\n      </g>\n      <text x=\"290\" y=\"504\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"8.5px\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#64748b\">* All 6 MPPA retail divisions (100% reconciled to audited Rp6,747B across 211 stores) are plotted according to Fred David IE criteria.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ie-breakdown-panel\">\n    <div class=\"ie-panel-head\">\n      <div class=\"ie-panel-title-group\">\n        <span>Portfolio &amp; Divisional Evaluation</span>\n        <span class=\"ie-chart-sub\">6 Retail Formats + Corporate Consolidated (All Plotted) · Fred David 9-Cell Mapping</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ie-format-selector\" role=\"tablist\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn is-active-fmt\" data-division=\"all\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('all')\">All</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"corporate\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('corporate')\">Corp</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"hypermart\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('hypermart')\">Hypermart</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"foodmart\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('foodmart')\">Foodmart</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('hyfresh')\">Hyfresh</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"boston\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('boston')\">Boston</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"smartclub\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('smartclub')\">SmartClub</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ie-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"fmx\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('fmx')\">FMX</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ie-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"ie-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Division &amp; Format</th>\n            <th>2020 Sales &amp; Share</th>\n            <th>IFE Score</th>\n            <th>EFE Score</th>\n            <th>IE Cell &amp; Prescription</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <!-- Row 1: Hypermart -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"hypermart\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('hypermart')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('hypermart')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/hypermart-logo.png\" alt=\"Hypermart\" class=\"ie-brand-logo\">\n                <div><strong>Hypermart</strong><small>100 stores · Big-Box Hypermarket</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp5,698 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\">84.5% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.16 (Avg)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.42 (Med)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-harvest\">Cell V / VIII Drag</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#73616c;margin-top:2px;\">Rightsizing &amp; Dark Stores</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 2: Foodmart & Primo -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"foodmart\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('foodmart')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('foodmart')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/foodmart-logo.png\" alt=\"Foodmart\" class=\"ie-brand-logo\">\n                <div><strong>Foodmart &amp; Primo</strong><small>25 stores · Supermarket &amp; Gourmet</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp689 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\">10.2% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.38 (Avg)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.52 (Med)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-hold\">Cell V Hold &amp; Maintain</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#73616c;margin-top:2px;\">Market Penetration (Gourmet)</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 3: Hyfresh -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('hyfresh')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('hyfresh')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/hyfresh-logo.png\" alt=\"Hyfresh\" class=\"ie-brand-logo\">\n                <div><strong>Hyfresh</strong><small>9 stores · Compact Fresh Supermarket</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp135 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\">2.0% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.85 (Avg)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-strong\">3.10 (High)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-grow\">Cell II Grow &amp; Build</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#00875a;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;\">Aggressive Store Rollout</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 4: Boston Health & Beauty -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"boston\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('boston')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('boston')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/boston-logo.png\" alt=\"Boston HBC\" class=\"ie-brand-logo\">\n                <div><strong>Boston Health &amp; Beauty</strong><small>62 stores · Pharmacy &amp; Personal Care</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp45 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\">0.7% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.75 (Avg)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-strong\">3.15 (High)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-grow\">Cell II Grow &amp; Build</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#00875a;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;\">Omnichannel &amp; Store-in-Store</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 5: SmartClub Wholesale -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"smartclub\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('smartclub')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('smartclub')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <div style=\"width:1.2cqw;height:1.2cqw;background:#7f1d1d;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:.65cqw;\">SC</div>\n                <div><strong>SmartClub Wholesale</strong><small>2 stores · B2B Cash &amp; Carry</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp134 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\">2.0% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-weak\">1.65 (Weak)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-weak\">1.60 (Low)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-harvest\">Cell IX Harvest / Divest</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#df0036;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;\">Liquidation &amp; Lease Exit</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 6: FMX Convenience Store (Unplotted) -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"fmx\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('fmx')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('fmx')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <img src=\"/assets/fmx-logo.png\" alt=\"FMX\" class=\"ie-brand-logo\">\n                <div><strong>FMX (Foodmart Xpress)</strong><small>14 stores · Convenience Store</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp46 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\" style=\"background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;\">0.7% Share</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-weak\">1.80 (Weak)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-weak\">1.85 (Low)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-harvest\">Cell IX Harvest/Divest</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Hy-Express Pilot (12–18 mo gate)</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Row 6: Corporate Consolidated -->\n          <tr class=\"ie-row\" data-division=\"corporate\" onclick=\"selectIeDivision('corporate')\" onmouseenter=\"inspectIeDivisionRow('corporate')\" onmouseleave=\"resetIeInspector()\" style=\"background:#fdf6ed;font-weight:700;\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td class=\"ie-td-fmt\">\n              <div class=\"ie-brand-cell\">\n                <div style=\"width:1.2cqw;height:1.2cqw;background:#b45309;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:.7cqw;\">★</div>\n                <div><strong>MPPA Corporate Total</strong><small>211 total stores · Consolidated</small></div>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-rev-val\">Rp6,747 B</span>\n              <span class=\"ie-share-pill\" style=\"background:#fef3c7;color:#b45309;\">100.0% Sales</span>\n            </td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.21 (Weighted)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"ie-score-badge score-avg\">2.46 (Weighted)</span></td>\n            <td>\n              <span class=\"ie-region-tag tag-hold\">Cell V Hold &amp; Maintain</span>\n              <small style=\"display:block;color:#b45309;margin-top:2px;\">Portfolio Restructuring</small>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Real-time calculation / prescription card -->\n    <div id=\"ie-calculation\">\n      <span class=\"ie-calc-idle\">ℹ️ Hover over any division row or chart bubble to see exact IFE/EFE diagnostics and Fred David strategies.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Summary takeaway card -->\n    <div class=\"ie-summary-card\">\n      <strong>Core Strategic Diagnosis:</strong> Corporate MPPA sits in <strong>Cell V (Hold and Maintain)</strong>. MPPA must execute the <em>Alfamart / Alfamidi Playbook</em>: (1) <strong>Brand Architecture:</strong> Rebrand and unify fragmented storefronts (Foodmart, Primo, viable express kiosks) under the single <strong>\"Hy-\" Master Brand Family (Hypermart &amp; Hyfresh)</strong>; (2) <strong>Format Distinctiveness:</strong> Distinctively establish <strong>Hyfresh</strong> as a dedicated 500–1,000 m² neighborhood fresh supermarket (60%+ fresh mix) distinct from big boxes and minimarkets; (3) <strong>Hybrid O2O Storefronts:</strong> Keep customer storefronts active to capture foot-traffic margins while embedding MPPA hybrid O2O micro-fulfillment storefronts; and (4) <strong>Selective Divestment:</strong> Liquidate subscale non-core assets (SmartClub B2B wholesale and unviable standalone convenience leases) to fund compact store expansion.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Case 23 pp. 588–596; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'IE'</span><span>25 / 30</span></div>"
  },
  {
    "label": "Slide 26: Grand Strategy Matrix (GSM)",
    "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy formulation · The matching stage (Grand Strategy Matrix)</div>\n<h2>Grand Strategy Matrix (GSM)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"gsm-inspector\" id=\"gsm-ins-box\">\n  <div class=\"gsm-ins-head\">\n    <span class=\"gsm-ins-pill gsm-pill-q3\" id=\"gsm-ins-pill\">QUADRANT III · WEAK POSITION &amp; SLOW GROWTH</span>\n    <span class=\"gsm-ins-title\" id=\"gsm-ins-title\">Corporate MPPA: Trapped in Quadrant III by Legacy Hypermarket Drag</span>\n    <span class=\"gsm-ins-source\" id=\"gsm-ins-source\">Case 23 pp. 588–596; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'GRAND'</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"gsm-ins-body\" id=\"gsm-ins-body\">\n    <strong>Strategic Diagnosis:</strong> Consolidated MPPA (X: 3.8, Y: 3.5) sits in Quadrant III due to overwhelming revenue concentration (84.5%) in contracting large-format hypermarkets (-12.0% CAGR). Under Fred R. David's GSM framework, Quadrant III organizations must execute <em>Retrenchment (downsizing large boxes)</em> and <em>Divestiture (liquidating unviable B2B wholesale)</em> while reallocating capital into Quadrant II high-growth compact formats (Hyfresh at X: 4.0, Y: 7.5).\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gsm-layout\">\n  <!-- Left Panel: Interactive Matrix Chart -->\n  <div class=\"gsm-chart-panel\">\n    <div class=\"gsm-panel-head\">\n      <div class=\"gsm-panel-title-group\">\n        <span>GRAND STRATEGY MATRIX (4 QUADRANTS)</span>\n        <span class=\"gsm-chart-sub\">X-Axis: Competitive Position (1–9) · Y-Axis: Market Growth (1–9)</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"gsm-format-selector\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter Format\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn is-active-fmt\" data-division=\"all\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('all')\">All</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"hypermart\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('hypermart')\">Hypermart</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"foodmart\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('foodmart')\">Foodmart</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('hyfresh')\">Hyfresh</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"boston\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('boston')\">Boston</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"smartclub\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('smartclub')\">SmartClub</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"fmx\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('fmx')\">FMX</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"gsm-fmt-btn\" data-division=\"corporate\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('corporate')\">Corporate</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SVG GSM Matrix -->\n    <svg class=\"gsm-svg\" viewBox=\"42 0 516 468\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n      <defs>\n        <filter id=\"gsm-shadow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n          <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"2.5\" flood-color=\"#1e181c\" flood-opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n        </filter>\n      </defs>\n\n      <!-- Quadrant Backgrounds -->\n      <!-- Q2: Top-Left (Rapid Growth, Weak Position) -->\n      <rect x=\"60\" y=\"40\" width=\"240\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#f0f7ff\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n      <!-- Q1: Top-Right (Rapid Growth, Strong Position) -->\n      <rect x=\"300\" y=\"40\" width=\"240\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n      <!-- Q3: Bottom-Left (Slow Growth, Weak Position) -->\n      <rect x=\"60\" y=\"220\" width=\"240\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#fef2f2\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n      <!-- Q4: Bottom-Right (Slow Growth, Strong Position) -->\n      <rect x=\"300\" y=\"220\" width=\"240\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#fffbeb\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n\n      <!-- Center Cross Axes -->\n      <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"410\" stroke=\"#1e181c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n      <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#1e181c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n\n      <!-- Axis Arrows -->\n      <polygon points=\"300,25 295,35 305,35\" fill=\"#1e181c\" />\n      <polygon points=\"300,415 295,405 305,405\" fill=\"#1e181c\" />\n      <polygon points=\"555,220 545,215 545,225\" fill=\"#1e181c\" />\n      <polygon points=\"45,220 55,215 55,225\" fill=\"#1e181c\" />\n\n      <!-- Outer Axis Labels -->\n      <text x=\"300\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#0055b8\">RAPID MARKET GROWTH (Y &gt; 5.0)</text>\n      <text x=\"300\" y=\"432\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#64748b\">SLOW MARKET GROWTH (Y &lt; 5.0)</text>\n\n      <!-- Quadrant Watermark Titles & Textbook Strategies -->\n      <!-- Q2 (Top-Left) -->\n      <g opacity=\"0.85\">\n        <text x=\"75\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#0369a1\">QUADRANT II</text>\n        <text x=\"75\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0284c7\">Weak Position · Rapid Growth</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- Q1 (Top-Right) -->\n      <g opacity=\"0.85\">\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#15803d\">QUADRANT I</text>\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#16a34a\">Strong Position · Rapid Growth</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- Q3 (Bottom-Left) -->\n      <g opacity=\"0.85\">\n        <text x=\"75\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">QUADRANT III</text>\n        <text x=\"75\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#dc2626\">Weak Position · Slow Growth</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- Q4 (Bottom-Right) -->\n      <g opacity=\"0.85\">\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#b45309\">QUADRANT IV</text>\n        <text x=\"315\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d97706\">Strong Position · Slow Growth</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- SVG BUBBLES -->\n      <!-- 1. Hypermart: X=3.6 -> cx=216, Y=2.5 -> cy=333, r=24 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-hypermart\" data-division=\"hypermart\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('hypermart')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"216\" cy=\"333\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#df0036\" fill-opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"216\" y=\"367\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">Hypermart</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 2. Foodmart & Primo: X=4.2 -> cx=252, Y=4.5 -> cy=243, r=14 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-foodmart\" data-division=\"foodmart\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('foodmart')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"243\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#d97706\" fill-opacity=\"0.85\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"232\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">Foodmart &amp; Primo</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 3. Hyfresh: X=4.0 -> cx=240, Y=7.5 -> cy=108, r=11 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-hyfresh\" data-division=\"hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('hyfresh')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"108\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#00875a\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"258\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">Hyfresh</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 4. Boston HBC: X=3.5 -> cx=210, Y=7.8 -> cy=94, r=9 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-boston\" data-division=\"boston\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('boston')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"94\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"194\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">Boston HBC</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 5. SmartClub: X=1.8 -> cx=108, Y=2.0 -> cy=355, r=9 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-smartclub\" data-division=\"smartclub\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('smartclub')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"108\" cy=\"355\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#7f1d1d\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"122\" y=\"359\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">SmartClub</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 6. FMX: X=1.8 -> cx=108, Y=2.2 -> cy=325, r=7 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-fmx\" data-division=\"fmx\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('fmx')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"108\" cy=\"325\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#64748b\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"95\" y=\"328\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">FMX</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <!-- 7. Corporate Total: X=3.8 -> cx=228, Y=3.5 -> cy=288, r=18 -->\n      <g class=\"gsm-bubble-group gsm-group-corporate\" data-division=\"corporate\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('corporate')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\">\n        <circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"288\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#b45309\" fill-opacity=\"0.88\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" filter=\"url(#gsm-shadow)\"/>\n        <text x=\"252\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"gsm-marker-label\">MPPA Corporate</text>\n      </g>\n    \n      <g font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#625762\">\n        <text x=\"60\" y=\"418\">1 · Weak</text>\n        <text x=\"300\" y=\"418\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text>\n        <text x=\"540\" y=\"418\" text-anchor=\"end\">9 · Strong</text>\n      </g>\n      <text x=\"300\" y=\"459\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#625762\">COMPETITIVE POSITION (X)</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right Panel: Division Breakdown Table & Calc Box -->\n  <div class=\"gsm-breakdown-panel\">\n    <div class=\"gsm-panel-head\">\n      <span class=\"gsm-table-title\">MPPA Portfolio GSM Classification</span>\n      <span class=\"gsm-chart-sub\">6 Formats + Consolidated · Fred David Strategy Match</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"gsm-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"gsm-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Format / Division</th>\n            <th>Sales &amp; Share</th>\n            <th>Comp. Pos. (X)</th>\n            <th>Market Gr. (Y)</th>\n            <th>GSM Quadrant</th>\n            <th>Prescribed Action</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"hypermart\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('hypermart')\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/hypermart-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Hypermart</strong><small>Large Format Hypermarket</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp5,698 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">84.5%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-weak\">3.6</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-weak\">2.5 (Slow)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q3\">Quadrant III</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Retrenchment:</strong> Downsize floorplates to 2,500 m² &amp; hybrid O2O</small></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"foodmart\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('foodmart')\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/foodmart-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Foodmart &amp; Primo</strong><small>Supermarket Banner</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp689 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">10.2%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-mid\">4.2</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-mid\">4.5 (Slow)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q3\">Quadrant III</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Rebrand &amp; Focus:</strong> Foodmart to Hyfresh; retain Primo luxury</small></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('hyfresh')\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/hyfresh-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Hyfresh</strong><small>Compact Fresh Supermarket</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp135 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">2.0%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-mid\">4.0</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-strong\">7.5 (Rapid)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q2\">Quadrant II</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Market Penetration:</strong> Rapid neighborhood rollout, grow fresh</small></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"boston\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('boston')\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/boston-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>Boston HBC</strong><small>Pharmacy &amp; Personal Care</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp45 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">0.7%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-weak\">3.5</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-strong\">7.8 (Rapid)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q2\">Quadrant II</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Store-in-Store:</strong> Embed in Hypermart/Hyfresh, exit standalone</small></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"smartclub\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('smartclub')\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/smartclub-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>SmartClub</strong><small>B2B Cash &amp; Carry</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp134 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">2.0%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-vweak\">1.8</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-vweak\">2.0 (Slow)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q3\">Quadrant III</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Divestiture:</strong> Complete liquidation of inventory &amp; lease exit</small></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"fmx\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('fmx')\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/fmx-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>FMX (Foodmart Xpress)</strong><small>14 kiosks · Convenience Store</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp46 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">0.7%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-vweak\">1.8</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-vweak\">2.2 (Slow)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q3\">Quadrant III</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Retrenchment &amp; Pilot:</strong> Exit mall kiosks; pilot Hy-Express</small></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"gsm-row\" data-division=\"corporate\" onclick=\"selectGsmDivision('corporate')\" style=\"background:#fdf6ed;font-weight:700;\" tabindex=\"0\">\n            <td><div class=\"gsm-brand-cell\"><img src=\"/assets/mppa-logo.png\" alt=\"\"><div><strong>★ Corporate Total</strong><small>Consolidated MPPA</small></div></div></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-rev\">Rp6,747 B</span><span class=\"gsm-share\">100.0%</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-mid\">3.8</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-score score-weak\">3.5 (Slow)</span></td>\n            <td><span class=\"gsm-quad-tag tag-q3\">Quadrant III</span></td>\n            <td><small><strong>Portfolio Rebalance:</strong> Fund Q2 formats using Q3 savings</small></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Mathematical calculation panel -->\n    <div class=\"gsm-calc-panel\" id=\"gsm-calculation\">\n      <div class=\"gsm-calc-header\">\n        <strong>Mathematical Derivation &amp; Methodology</strong>\n        <span class=\"gsm-calc-pill\">Fred R. David (2023) Framework</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"gsm-calc-body\">\n        <p>• <strong>X-Axis (Competitive Position):</strong> Scored 1 to 9 (5.0 midpoint). Anchored to CPM rating (MPPA: 3.11 vs Indomaret: 3.51 &amp; Alfamart: 3.42). Hypermarket box drag (3.6) and subscale convenience/wholesale lower corporate score to <strong>3.8 (Weak)</strong>.</p>\n        <p>• <strong>Y-Axis (Market Growth Rate):</strong> Scored 1 to 9 (5.0 midpoint). Hypermarket industry sales contracted by -12.0% in 2020 (Score: 2.5), while compact community fresh expanded +10.0% (Score: 7.5) and health/wellness grew +14.0% (Score: 7.8). Weighted corporate market growth is <strong>3.5 (Slow)</strong>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Case 23 pp. 588–596; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'GRAND'</span><span>26 / 30</span></div>",
    "short": "GSM Matrix"
  },
  {
    "label": "Slide 27: Quantitative Strategic Planning Matrix (QSPM)",
    "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy formulation · The decision stage (QSPM)</div>\n<h2>Quantitative Strategic Planning Matrix (QSPM)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"qspm-inspector\" id=\"qspm-ins-box\">\n  <div class=\"qspm-ins-head\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-strat-card winner\" data-qspm-strategy=\"1\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">\n      <img class=\"qspm-strategy-image\" src=\"/assets/qspm-hyfresh-expansion.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\">\n      <span class=\"qspm-card-badge\"><img class=\"qspm-brand-logo\" src=\"/assets/hyfresh-logo.png\" alt=\"\">Strategy 1 · PRIMARY GROWTH STRATEGY</span>\n      <span class=\"qspm-card-title\">Expand compact Hyfresh stores and consolidate banners under Hy-</span>\n      <span class=\"qspm-card-tas\"><strong>6.620</strong><span>Total score</span></span>\n    </button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-strat-card comp\" data-qspm-strategy=\"2\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">\n      <img class=\"qspm-strategy-image\" src=\"/assets/qspm-hypermart-fulfillment.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"600\">\n      <span class=\"qspm-card-badge\"><img class=\"qspm-brand-logo\" src=\"/assets/hypermart-logo.png\" alt=\"\">Strategy 2 · COMPLEMENTARY INITIATIVE</span>\n      <span class=\"qspm-card-title\">Resize Hypermart stores and use them to fulfill online orders</span>\n      <span class=\"qspm-card-tas\"><strong>5.460</strong><span>Total score</span></span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"qspm-layout\">\n  <!-- Category scores and decision summary -->\n  <div class=\"qspm-summary-col\">\n    <div class=\"qspm-panel-head\">\n      <span>DECISION SUMMARY</span>\n      <span class=\"qspm-chart-sub\">Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'QSPM' Row 66</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qspm-scorecard-grid\">\n      <div class=\"qspm-cat-card\">\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-title\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-S\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-3 7-10V5l-7-3-7 3v7c0 7 7 10 7 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg><span>STRENGTHS (S1–S10) <small>Weight: 0.45</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-scores\">\n          <span>Strat 1 TAS: <b>1.450</b></span>\n          <span>Strat 2 TAS: <b>1.250</b></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-delta pos\">Strat 1 Leads by +0.200</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"qspm-cat-card\">\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-title\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-W\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3 17.7 9.3 21 6a6 6 0 0 1-7.7 7.7L7 20a2.1 2.1 0 1 1-3-3l6.3-6.3A6 6 0 0 1 18 3l-3.3 3.3Z\"/></svg><span>WEAKNESSES (W1–W10) <small>Weight: 0.55</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-scores\">\n          <span>Strat 1 TAS: <b>1.920</b></span>\n          <span>Strat 2 TAS: <b>1.470</b></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-delta pos\">Strat 1 Leads by +0.450</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"qspm-cat-card\">\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-title\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-O\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 19l6-6 4 4 8-10m-6 0h6v6\"/></svg><span>OPPORTUNITIES (O1–O10) <small>Weight: 0.50</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-scores\">\n          <span>Strat 1 TAS: <b>1.590</b></span>\n          <span>Strat 2 TAS: <b>1.550</b></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-delta pos\">Strat 1 Leads by +0.040</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"qspm-cat-card\">\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-title\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-T\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20L12 3Zm0 6v5m0 3v.1\"/></svg><span>THREATS (T1–T10) <small>Weight: 0.50</small></span></div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-scores\">\n          <span>Strat 1 TAS: <b>1.660</b></span>\n          <span>Strat 2 TAS: <b>1.190</b></span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qspm-cat-delta pos\">Strat 1 Leads by +0.470</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Strategic Decision Verdict -->\n    <div class=\"qspm-verdict-box\">\n      <h3>Hyfresh leads by 1.160 points</h3>\n      <p>Threats (+0.470) and weaknesses (+0.450) account for most of Strategy 1’s lead.</p>\n      <p>Use Hypermart resizing to release cash for the Hyfresh rollout.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Factor ratings and filters -->\n  <div class=\"qspm-factors-col\">\n    <div class=\"qspm-panel-head\">\n      <span>FACTOR RATINGS</span>\n      <div class=\"qspm-filter-bar\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-flt-btn is-active-flt\" data-cat=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\" onclick=\"filterQspmRows('all')\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-all\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"4\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"14\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>All</span></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-flt-btn\" data-cat=\"S\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"filterQspmRows('S')\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-S\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 22s7-3 7-10V5l-7-3-7 3v7c0 7 7 10 7 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg><span>Strengths</span></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-flt-btn\" data-cat=\"W\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"filterQspmRows('W')\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-W\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3 17.7 9.3 21 6a6 6 0 0 1-7.7 7.7L7 20a2.1 2.1 0 1 1-3-3l6.3-6.3A6 6 0 0 1 18 3l-3.3 3.3Z\"/></svg><span>Weaknesses</span></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-flt-btn\" data-cat=\"O\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"filterQspmRows('O')\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-O\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 19l6-6 4 4 8-10m-6 0h6v6\"/></svg><span>Opportunities</span></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-flt-btn\" data-cat=\"T\" aria-pressed=\"false\" onclick=\"filterQspmRows('T')\"><svg class=\"qspm-icon qspm-icon-T\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20L12 3Zm0 6v5m0 3v.1\"/></svg><span>Threats</span></button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qspm-table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"QSPM factor ratings\">\n      <table class=\"qspm-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th style=\"width:52%;\">Key Strategic Factor (IFE / EFE Diagnostic)</th>\n            <th style=\"width:10%;\">Weight</th>\n            <th style=\"width:9%;\">Strat. 1 AS</th>\n            <th style=\"width:10%;\">Strat. 1 TAS</th>\n            <th style=\"width:9%;\">Strat. 2 AS</th>\n            <th style=\"width:10%;\">Strat. 2 TAS</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Fresh food is central to Hyfresh. Resized Hypermarts still sell it, but their main goal is store efficiency.\" data-weight-reason=\"Fresh food drives repeat visits and a large share of revenue.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S1\">S1</button> Perishable fresh food revenue contribution expanding to 27.7% of total sales in 2020 (+3.7% YoY from 24.0% in 2019), acting as the primary store foot-traffic anchor (AR2020 p. 38).</td>\n            <td>0.07</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.280</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.210</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh depends on reliable chilled supply at each new store. Hypermart resizing uses the same network mainly to support existing stores.\" data-weight-reason=\"Cold-chain reliability is central to the fresh-food offer.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S2\">S2</button> Three centralized multi-temperature distribution centers totaling 66,755 m² equipped with cold-chain storage protecting perishable food quality (AR2020 pp. 38, 126).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.180</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can learn from the network, but resizing directly reuses the existing Hypermart sites.\" data-weight-reason=\"Store locations influence access and market reach.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S3\">S3</button> Extensive national modern hypermarket network of 100 Hypermart stores across 73 cities spanning Sumatra to Papua, securing prime urban commercial real estate (Case Exhibit 6, p. 592; AR2020 p. 12).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.100</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh expansion is mainly a physical-store strategy. Hypermart fulfillment uses the ordering channels more directly, although it still needs execution at store level.\" data-weight-reason=\"Online fulfillment helped keep stores productive during mobility restrictions.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S4\">S4</button> Rapid multi-platform omnichannel expansion deploying Hypermart Online in 103 stores, WhatsApp Chat & Shop in 125 stores, and GrabMart in 97 stores without fleet capex (AR2020 p. 25).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.050</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.100</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can use supplier relationships to stock new stores. Resizing focuses on floor space and fulfillment, with little direct change to sourcing.\" data-weight-reason=\"Supplier terms affect availability and purchase costs.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S5\">S5</button> Direct supplier relationships with over 750 FMCG vendors with 53.8% of goods routed through central DCs, ensuring supply continuity and vendor allowances (AR2020 pp. 12, 126).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.040</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Halal handling supports Hyfresh’s fresh-food promise across new stores. Hypermart also benefits, but certification is less central to resizing.\" data-weight-reason=\"Halal handling matters to customers who rely on that assurance.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S6\">S6</button> National Halal Logistics Certification awarded to all three central distribution centers, the first modern retailer in Indonesia to achieve full Halal supply chain compliance (AR2020 pp. 25, 41).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh expansion directly scales the existing neighborhood format. Resizing Hypermart works on a different format.\" data-weight-reason=\"Smaller formats can reach shoppers underserved by large stores.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S7\">S7</button> Established neighborhood fresh supermarket operations through 23 Foodmart supermarkets and 2 pilot Hyfresh stores providing compact community grocery formats (Case Exhibit 4; AR2020 pp. 46–47).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.040</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"A shared Hy- brand gives private labels more shelf space across new stores. Smaller Hypermarts can still sell them, but resizing does not focus on brand expansion.\" data-weight-reason=\"Private labels help balance affordability and margin.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S8\">S8</button> Proprietary private label portfolio under Value Plus and Hypermart brands covering 1,200+ staple SKUs at 15–20% lower price points, delivering 300–500 bps higher gross margins (AR2020 p. 45).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh keeps the focus on retail shoppers. Resizing applies that focus directly by refitting existing stores for retail and online orders.\" data-weight-reason=\"Management focus affects where limited resources go.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S9\">S9</button> Strategic retail simplification exiting low-margin B2B wholesale activities to focus 100% on direct consumer grocery retailing, protecting gross margin at 16.7% (Case p. 587; AR2020 p. 38).</td>\n            <td>0.03</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.090</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"S\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can use Hicard to attract repeat shoppers. Hypermart fulfillment can reach members through the stores and channels they already use.\" data-weight-reason=\"Loyalty data supports retention and targeted offers.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor S10\">S10</button> Registered loyalty customer base of approximately 3.5 million Hicard members across hypermarket and supermarket banners, capturing customer repeat purchase data (Case Exhibit 4; AR2020 p. 43).</td>\n            <td>0.03</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.090</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-subtotal-row\" data-cat=\"S\">\n            <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Strengths Subtotal (10 Factors)</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong style=\"color:#00875a;\">1.450</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong>1.250</strong></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh changes the growth model toward smaller stores. Resizing also tackles losses, but works within the existing Hypermart network.\" data-weight-reason=\"Persistent losses threaten the ability to fund the business.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W1\">W1</button> Four consecutive years of severe net losses totaling −Rp3.53 trillion from 2017 to 2020 (−Rp887.5 billion in 2020), eroding shareholder equity down to Rp460.6 billion (AR2020 p. 53; Case Exhibit 5).</td>\n            <td>0.08</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.320</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.240</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"A smaller store model can improve cash generation over time. Resizing can reduce costs, but store conversions can require cash before savings arrive.\" data-weight-reason=\"Operating cash pays for inventory and day-to-day expenses.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W2\">W2</button> Negative operating cash flow of −Rp80.4 billion in 2020 (reversing from +Rp162.7 billion in 2019), preventing internally funded store renovations or digital capex (AR2020 p. 56).</td>\n            <td>0.07</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.210</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.140</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh adds revenue from another format. Resizing reduces the burden per Hypermart while keeping sales dependent on that format.\" data-weight-reason=\"Concentration makes a single format’s decline a company-wide risk.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W3\">W3</button> Structural over-reliance on large-format hypermarkets with Hypermart generating 84.5% of gross sales (Rp5.71 trillion of Rp6.75 trillion), suffering high operational friction (Case Exhibit 5; AR2020 p. 38).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"Neighborhood Hyfresh stores reduce reliance on mall visits. Hypermart fulfillment helps offset lost foot traffic, but still uses mall-linked sites.\" data-weight-reason=\"Store traffic affects sales while occupancy costs remain due.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W4\">W4</button> Vulnerability of store network to shopping mall curfews with over 80% of Hypermart stores anchored inside enclosed shopping malls subject to 50% capacity restrictions (Case p. 587; AR2020 p. 38).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.180</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"New Hyfresh stores do little to change existing leases. Resizing targets leased space directly and can support rent renegotiation.\" data-weight-reason=\"Committed lease costs limit the cash available for recovery.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W5\">W5</button> Heavy fixed lease financing burden under PSAK 73 with Rp166.2 billion in net finance costs on Rp2.25 trillion in lease liabilities, consuming 14.8% of gross profit (AR2020 pp. 54–55).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh starts with a smaller sales floor. Resizing can improve existing space use, but benefits depend on what MPPA can do with the excess area.\" data-weight-reason=\"Sales per square meter show whether stores earn enough from their space.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W6\">W6</button> Depressed sales productivity per square meter of Rp8.9 million/m² in 2020 (contracting −26.4% YoY), less than half of competitor Alfamidi at Rp18.2 million/m² (AR2020 p. 12; Competitor ARs).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.150</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.100</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"The Hy- strategy directly consolidates small-store brands. Hypermart resizing leaves that fragmentation largely in place.\" data-weight-reason=\"Fragmented brands make expansion and marketing less efficient.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W7\">W7</button> Small-format brand fragmentation across four separate sub-scale banners (Foodmart, Primo, Hyfresh, FMX) totaling only 36 stores, diluting marketing spend (Case Exhibit 4; AR2020 p. 46).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.050</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh may improve cash turnover, but expansion requires inventory and setup costs. Resizing can release cash tied up in existing stores.\" data-weight-reason=\"The shortfall affects the ability to pay near-term bills.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W8\">W8</button> Chronically negative working capital position of −Rp972 billion with current liabilities (Rp3.46 trillion) exceeding current assets (Rp2.49 trillion), extending trade payables to 134 days (AR2020 p. 51).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"A smaller Hyfresh footprint limits fixed costs from the start. Resizing cuts some overhead but can leave existing commitments in place.\" data-weight-reason=\"Fixed costs make profits more sensitive to sales declines.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W9\">W9</button> High fixed operating costs for large hypermarket buildings consuming 18.2% of net sales in 2020 (up from 16.5% in 2019) due to inflexible utility, electricity, and store staffing expenses (AR2020 p. 53).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"W\" data-hover-reason=\"A shared Hy- brand can support a direct relationship with repeat shoppers. Hypermart fulfillment improves convenience, but can still rely on partner apps.\" data-weight-reason=\"Direct customer data and commission costs matter for profitable repeat orders.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor W10\">W10</button> Absence of a proprietary high-engagement loyalty mobile application, relying on third-party aggregators (Grab, Shopee) without an integrated ecosystem like Alfamart’s Alfagift (>8M downloads) (AR2020 p. 25).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-subtotal-row\" data-cat=\"W\">\n            <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Weaknesses Subtotal (10 Factors)</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong style=\"color:#00875a;\">1.920</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong>1.470</strong></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can add online orders, but Hypermart fulfillment directly turns existing stores into hubs for growing online demand.\" data-weight-reason=\"Online growth changed where customers bought groceries.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O1\">O1</button> Expansion of Indonesian e-commerce GMV by +54% YoY to $32 billion in 2020, with daily essentials and groceries emerging as the fastest-surging category (Google-Temasek-Bain 2020).</td>\n            <td>0.07</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.140</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.280</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh expansion changes where people shop in person. Hypermart fulfillment fits digital adoption more closely, though it does not itself create a new customer platform.\" data-weight-reason=\"A lasting channel shift affects repeat sales.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O2\">O2</button> Adoption of digital services by 37% of Indonesian consumers for the first time during 2020, with 93% intending to continue digital purchasing post-pandemic (e-Conomy SEA 2020).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.060</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh meets everyday staple demand nearby. Hypermart can also serve larger staple orders through its broader assortment and fulfillment network.\" data-weight-reason=\"Staples generate frequent shopping trips.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O3\">O3</button> Massive, non-cyclical retail demand for staple foods in Indonesia generating $30.7 billion across modern and general trade in 2020, anchored by rice ($9,587M) and packaged drinks ($6,477M) (Case Exhibit 7).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.180</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh makes fresh ingredients easy to buy on frequent trips. Hypermart can fill cooking-related orders, but is less focused on neighborhood shopping.\" data-weight-reason=\"Home cooking directly affects demand for fresh ingredients.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O4\">O4</button> Consumer behavioral shift toward home cooking reported by 82% of Indonesian households, alongside a 49% reduction in dining out during mobility curbs (Nielsen April 2020).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.150</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Neighborhood Hyfresh stores can serve essential trips close to home. Hypermart also qualifies as essential retail, but mall access can still limit visits.\" data-weight-reason=\"The exemption helped preserve store sales during restrictions.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O5\">O5</button> Government regulatory exemption under DKI Jakarta Pergub No. 33/2020 permitting supermarkets and food retail logistics to remain operational during PSBB restrictions (7 April 2020).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.150</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh directly answers demand for nearby fresh-food stores. Resizing changes store size without necessarily moving closer to households.\" data-weight-reason=\"Proximity matters for frequent grocery trips.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O6\">O6</button> Consumer preference migration toward localized, neighborhood-based fresh food formats to avoid congested regional shopping hubs (AR2020 pp. 46–47).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.100</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh uses the cold chain to support a fresh-led network. Hypermart fulfillment also needs it, but handles a wider mix of products.\" data-weight-reason=\"Cold storage protects product quality and reduces spoilage.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O7\">O7</button> High logistical barrier of cold-chain infrastructure requirements for perishable fresh food, insulating fresh produce from ambient e-commerce platforms like Shopee and Tokopedia (AR2020 p. 38).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.150</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Compact stores can place dispatch closer to households. Resized Hypermarts can also dispatch orders, but their existing locations limit neighborhood coverage.\" data-weight-reason=\"Delivery adds reach without requiring more stores.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O8\">O8</button> Rapid emergence of third-party on-demand delivery fleets (GrabMart, GoSend) enabling multi-platform fulfillment without retailer fleet capex (AR2020 p. 25; Hero AR2020 p. 96).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can design fresh inventory around frequent local demand. Hypermart resizing can help reduce waste, but that is a secondary benefit of refitting stores.\" data-weight-reason=\"Spoilage cuts margins on fresh goods.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O9\">O9</button> National food loss and waste estimated by Bappenas at 23–48 million tonnes annually, creating margin-enhancement potential through inventory shelf-life optimization (Bappenas 2021 study).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"O\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can use centralized supply. Hypermart fulfillment makes more direct use of established distribution flows to stock existing high-volume sites.\" data-weight-reason=\"Reliable distribution helps keep shelves stocked.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor O10\">O10</button> Dispersed FMCG supplier network relying on modern retail central distribution centers to reach urban consumer markets during regional transit disruptions (AR2020 pp. 12, 126).</td>\n            <td>0.03</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.090</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-subtotal-row\" data-cat=\"O\">\n            <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Opportunities Subtotal (10 Factors)</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong style=\"color:#00875a;\">1.590</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong>1.550</strong></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh competes closer to shoppers’ homes. Resizing a Hypermart does little to match minimarket proximity if the site stays the same.\" data-weight-reason=\"Neighborhood access influences routine store choice.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T1\">T1</button> Massive network of over 33,500 neighborhood minimarkets (Indomaret 18,113 stores; Alfamart 15,434 stores) capturing daily walking grocery runs and bypassing mall hypermarkets (Indoritel & Alfamart AR2020).</td>\n            <td>0.08</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.320</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td>0.160</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh does little to narrow the buying-power gap. Hypermart can use existing order volume and assortment, but still faces much larger chains.\" data-weight-reason=\"Buying power affects purchase costs and retail prices.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T2\">T2</button> Minimarket duopoly commanding $9.15 billion in combined 2020 sales (Indomaret $4,900M; Alfamart $4,256M), providing massive volume purchasing rebates and lower retail prices (Case Exhibit 8).</td>\n            <td>0.07</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.070</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-2\">2</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.140</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh captures everyday purchases in smaller baskets. Resizing more directly lowers the overhead that becomes harder to cover when spending falls.\" data-weight-reason=\"Household spending directly affects sales volume and mix.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T3\">T3</button> Drop in national real household grocery spending by −2.63% in 2020 (reversing from +5.04% in 2019), reducing family disposable income and shopping basket sizes (Bank Indonesia / BPS Q2 2021, p. 8).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.180</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh takes growth outside mall-dependent sites. Hypermart fulfillment reduces reliance on visits but keeps existing mall exposure.\" data-weight-reason=\"Mall foot traffic matters because so much revenue depends on Hypermart.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T4\">T4</button> Sharp decline in destination shopping mall visitors due to government COVID-19 capacity caps (50%) and early evening closing hours (Case p. 587; AR2020 p. 38).</td>\n            <td>0.06</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.240</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.180</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"A shared Hy- brand gives MPPA a basis for building its own repeat-customer relationship. Resizing alone does little to close a loyalty-app gap.\" data-weight-reason=\"Loyalty apps help retailers retain customers and learn what they buy.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T5\">T5</button> Competitor direct-to-consumer loyalty penetration led by Alfamart’s Alfagift app exceeding 8 million downloads and 9.3 million loyalty members (Alfamart AR2020, p. 32).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.050</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh meets Alfamidi in the neighborhood fresh-food format. Resizing Hypermart does not directly replicate that proximity.\" data-weight-reason=\"Nearby fresh-food rivals compete for repeat grocery trips.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T6\">T6</button> Expansion of mid-sized residential fresh supermarkets led by Alfamidi (1,821 stores, 24.1% gross margin) combining neighborhood proximity with fresh produce and meat (Alfamidi AR2020, pp. 24, 60).</td>\n            <td>0.05</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.200</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.050</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh limits exposure on new stores. Hypermart resizing targets the existing leased footprint, where the current burden sits.\" data-weight-reason=\"Fixed leases amplify cash pressure when sales fall.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T7\">T7</button> Implementation of PSAK 73 lease accounting rules converting operating leases into fixed right-of-use asset depreciation and finance interest charges, adding Rp166.2 billion in net finance costs (AR2020 pp. 54–55).</td>\n            <td>0.04</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.120</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.160</b></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Freshness and proximity give shoppers reasons to return to Hyfresh. Resizing alone offers little differentiation for customers comparing stores.\" data-weight-reason=\"Customers can switch stores easily when prices differ.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T8\">T8</button> Zero consumer switching costs between grocery retailers, with shoppers actively comparing promotional discounts and splitting baskets across competing formats (Case Exhibit 8; Nielsen 2020).</td>\n            <td>0.03</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.090</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-1\">1</span></td>\n            <td>0.030</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh can attract nearby walk-in and pickup orders, reducing reliance on paid delivery. Hypermart fulfillment can grow orders but may still pay platform fees.\" data-weight-reason=\"Commission costs determine how profitable online orders are.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T9\">T9</button> Take-rate commissions (5%–15%) and platform delivery fees charged by on-demand delivery aggregators (Grab, Shopee, Tokopedia), squeezing slim grocery gross margins (Industry benchmark 2020).</td>\n            <td>0.03</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.090</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-row\" data-cat=\"T\" data-hover-reason=\"Hyfresh gives MPPA a way to compete through freshness and proximity. Resizing preserves cash, but offers less differentiation against well-funded rivals.\" data-weight-reason=\"Cash reserves determine how long retailers can fund discounts.\">\n            <td><button type=\"button\" class=\"qspm-factor-detail\" aria-label=\"View details for factor T10\">T10</button> Deep balance sheet liquidity of competing retail conglomerates (Salim Group / Indoritel cash reserves; Sumber Alfaria cash flow; Lotte Shopping backing), enabling sustained promotional subsidies (Competitor AR2020 disclosures).</td>\n            <td>0.03</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-4\">4</span></td>\n            <td><b>0.120</b></td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-as as-3\">3</span></td>\n            <td>0.090</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"qspm-subtotal-row\" data-cat=\"T\">\n            <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Threats Subtotal (10 Factors)</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong style=\"color:#00875a;\">1.660</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><strong>1.190</strong></td>\n          </tr>\n          <!-- TOTAL ROW -->\n          <tr class=\"qspm-total-row\">\n            <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>SUM TOTAL ATTRACTIVENESS SCORE (TAS)</strong></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-total-pill s1\">6.620</span></td>\n            <td>—</td>\n            <td><span class=\"qspm-total-pill s2\">5.460</span></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"qspm-legend\"><p>Strat. 1 = Hyfresh expansion and Hy- consolidation. Strat. 2 = Hypermart resizing and online fulfillment.</p><p>AS = Attractiveness Score (1–4), a judgment of how well each strategy addresses the factor.</p><p>Weight = the factor’s importance from the IFE or EFE matrix. TAS = Total Attractiveness Score for that row (Weight × AS). The overall score is the sum of the row scores.</p><p>S / W / O / T = Strength / Weakness / Opportunity / Threat. S1 and S2 in the first column mean Strength 1 and Strength 2.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'QSPM'</span><span>27 / 30</span></div>",
    "short": "QSPM Matrix"
  },
  {"label": "Slide 28: Strategy Formulation (Matched Strategic Alternatives)", "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy formulation \u00b7 Stage 2 &amp; 3 strategic synthesis</div>\n<h2>Strategy Formulation: Matched Strategic Alternatives</h2>\n\n<div class=\"alt-top-bar\">\n  <div class=\"alt-filter-group\" role=\"tablist\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"alt-flt-btn is-active-flt\" data-cluster=\"all\" onclick=\"filterStratAlternatives('all')\">All Strategies (9)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"alt-flt-btn\" data-cluster=\"intensive\" onclick=\"filterStratAlternatives('intensive')\">Intensive Growth (3)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"alt-flt-btn\" data-cluster=\"defensive\" onclick=\"filterStratAlternatives('defensive')\">Defensive Restructuring (3)</button>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"alt-flt-btn\" data-cluster=\"integration\" onclick=\"filterStratAlternatives('integration')\">Supply Chain &amp; Moat (3)</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"alt-top-pill\">\n    <span>Fred David Taxonomy</span> \u00b7 Sample PPT Slides 19\u201329 Synthesis\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"alt-layout\">\n  <!-- Left Column: Strategy Cards List -->\n  <div class=\"alt-cards-col\" id=\"alt-cards-container\">\n    \n    <!-- 1. Market Penetration -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card is-active-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-1\" data-cluster=\"intensive\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-1')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">1. Market Penetration <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 24</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-intensive\">Intensive Growth</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT SO-3, ST-2</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">GSM Quad II</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">BCG Question Mark</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag qspm-tag\">QSPM Strategy 1 Anchor</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Rapid rollout of 40 compact neighborhood <strong>Hyfresh</strong> supermarkets (500\u20131,000 m\u00b2) in high-density residential catchments, capturing daily perishable grocery foot-traffic from wet markets and minimarkets.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 2. Market Development -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-2\" data-cluster=\"intensive\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-2')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">2. Market Development <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 23</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-intensive\">Intensive Growth</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT WT-1, ST-4</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">GSM Quad II</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">IE Cell II</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag qspm-tag\">Hy- Express Pilot</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Deploying modular 50\u2013150 m\u00b2 grab-and-go fresh kiosks (<strong>Hy-Express</strong>) in commuter transit nodes (rail stations, MRT hubs, office lobbies) to capture walking commuter breakfast and dinner runs.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 3. Product Development -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-3\" data-cluster=\"intensive\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-3')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">3. Product Development <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 25</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-intensive\">Intensive Growth</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT SO-2, ST-3</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">IFE Strength S8</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">Private Label Moat</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Expanding proprietary private label lines (<strong>Value Plus</strong> &amp; <strong>Hy-Fresh Direct</strong>) to 2,000 staple SKUs at 15\u201320% lower price points, delivering 300\u2013500 bps higher gross margins than FMCG brands.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 4. Retrenchment (Floor Rightsizing) -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-4\" data-cluster=\"defensive\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-4')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">4. Retrenchment: Floor Rightsizing <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 28</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-defensive\">Defensive</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT WO-1, WT-2</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SPACE Competitive</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">GSM Quad III</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag qspm-tag\">QSPM Strategy 2 Complement</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Downsizing 100 large <strong>Hypermart</strong> stores from 6,000 m\u00b2 to 2,500 m\u00b2 active selling area. Subleasing 3,500 m\u00b2 backrooms to dark stores and complementary retail to eliminate ~Rp450B in PSAK 73 lease debt.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 5. Divestiture (Format Pruning) -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-5\" data-cluster=\"defensive\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-5')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">5. Divestiture: Non-Core Pruning <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 29</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-defensive\">Defensive</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT WT-1, WO-4</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">BCG Dogs</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">IE Cell IX</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">Liquidation of Drag</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Exiting low-margin B2B wholesale commitments (<strong>SmartClub</strong>, 2 stores) and pruning unprofitable convenience kiosks (<strong>FMX</strong>, 14 stores) to liberate Rp120B in trapped working capital into Hyfresh.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 6. Lease Restructuring (Variable Rent) -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-6\" data-cluster=\"defensive\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-6')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">6. Retrenchment: Lease Restructuring <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 28</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-defensive\">Defensive</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT WT-2</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">IFE Weakness W5</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">PSAK 73 De-risking</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Converting fixed commercial mall leases into variable revenue-share contracts (3%\u20135% of monthly gross sales) with Lippo Malls and third-party mall developers to protect operating cash flow during curfews.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 7. Forward Integration (Omnichannel) -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-7\" data-cluster=\"integration\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-7')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">7. Forward Integration: O2O Omnichannel <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 22</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-integration\">Supply Chain</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT SO-1, SO-4</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">IFE Strength S4</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">EFE Opp O1, O8</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">Zero CapEx Fleet</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Deploying on-demand grocery fulfillment across GrabMart, Shopee, and WhatsApp Chat &amp; Shop in 103 stores. Utilizing aggregator fleets to expand digital grocery penetration from 5.4% to &gt;15% of sales.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 8. Backward Integration (Cold Chain) -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-8\" data-cluster=\"integration\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-8')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">8. Backward Integration: Farm-to-Store <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 21</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-integration\">Supply Chain</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT SO-2, WO-3</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">IFE Strength S2</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">66,755 m\u00b2 DC Moat</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Contracting direct farm sourcing for beef, poultry, and vegetables routed through MPPA\u2019s 3 central cold-chain DCs (Balaraja, Porong, Cibitung), cutting intermediate distributor fees and food waste.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 9. Related Diversification (HBC Pods) -->\n    <div class=\"alt-card\" data-strat-id=\"strat-9\" data-cluster=\"integration\" onclick=\"selectStratAlternative('strat-9')\">\n      <div class=\"alt-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"alt-card-title\">9. Related Diversification: HBC Pods <span class=\"alt-sample-ref\">Sample Slide 25</span></span>\n        <span class=\"alt-badge badge-diversification\">Diversification</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alt-matrix-tags\">\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">SWOT SO-3</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">GSM Quad II</span>\n        <span class=\"alt-tag\">Portfolio Synergy</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"alt-card-desc\">Co-locating <strong>Boston Health &amp; Beauty</strong> pharmacy and wellness pods inside compact Hyfresh supermarkets, driving high-margin basket cross-selling (28%\u201332% gross margin personal care items).</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right Column: Strategic Inspector & Red Thread -->\n  <div class=\"alt-ins-col\">\n    <div class=\"alt-ins-head\">\n      <span class=\"alt-ins-role\" id=\"alt-ins-role\">PRIMARY STRATEGIC VECTOR \u00b7 QSPM WINNER (TAS 6.620)</span>\n      <div class=\"alt-ins-title\" id=\"alt-ins-title\">1. Market Penetration: Compact Neighborhood Supermarkets (Hyfresh)</div>\n      <span class=\"alt-ins-type\" id=\"alt-ins-type\">Fred David Strategy Classification: Intensive Growth \u00b7 Sample PPT Slide 24</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"alt-ins-body\" id=\"alt-ins-body\">\n      <div class=\"alt-ins-sec\">\n        <span class=\"alt-sec-title\">Fred David Framework &amp; Sample PPT Context</span>\n        <p class=\"alt-sec-p\" id=\"alt-ins-ctx\">Fred David defines <strong>Market Penetration</strong> as seeking increased market share for present products in present markets through greater operational density. In the sample deck (Slide 24), this represents the primary aggressive growth tool to defend core grocery share against aggressive competitor rollouts.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"alt-ins-sec\">\n        <span class=\"alt-sec-title\">Analytical Roots Across Stage 2 Matrices</span>\n        <p class=\"alt-sec-p\" id=\"alt-ins-roots\">\n          \u2022 <strong>SWOT Matrix (Slide 22):</strong> Formulated under SO-3 (S3+S6+O4+O5+O6) &amp; ST-2 (S1+S4+T1+T6).<br>\n          \u2022 <strong>SPACE Matrix (Slide 23):</strong> Matches the Competitive posture (+0.60, -2.80) prescribing high market penetration.<br>\n          \u2022 <strong>BCG Matrix (Slide 24):</strong> Hyfresh operates as a high-growth Question Mark needing capital injection to become a Star.<br>\n          \u2022 <strong>GSM Matrix (Slide 26):</strong> Quadrant II points to intensive growth strategies (penetration &amp; development).\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"alt-bridge-box\" id=\"alt-ins-bridge\">\n        <strong>Strategic Transition to Slide 29:</strong>\n        <span id=\"alt-ins-bridge-txt\">Consolidated into <strong>Strategy 1</strong> in QSPM, achieving the winning Total Attractiveness Score of <strong>6.620</strong>. Forms <strong>Strategy 1</strong> of the final Strategic Recommendations on Slide 29.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 5 &amp; 6; Case 23; Sample PPT Slides 19\u201329 \u00b7 Matahari.xlsx</span><span>28 / 30</span></div>", "short": "Strategy Formulation"},
  {"label": "Slide 29: Strategic Recommendations", "short": "Recommendations", "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategic recommendations · Stage 4 · Implementation blueprint</div>\n<h2>Strategic Recommendations: QSPM Action Plan</h2>\n<p class=\"rec-subtitle\">Translating QSPM decision matrix and Fred David Stage 2/3 formulation into an actionable transformation agenda (2021–2025)</p>\n\n<div class=\"rec-status-pill\" style=\"margin-bottom:.5cqw;\">\n  <span class=\"rec-dot\"></span>\n  <span class=\"rec-status-txt\">QSPM Strategy 1 (6.620 TAS) &amp; Strategy 2 (5.460 TAS) · Zero Debt Funded</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"rec-cards-grid\">\n  <!-- STRATEGY 1 -->\n  <div class=\"rec-card p-growth is-active\" data-rec=\"r1\" onclick=\"selectRecommendation('r1')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"rec-card-top\">\n      <span class=\"rec-card-tag tag-growth\">STRATEGY 1 · PRIMARY GROWTH</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-qspm-badge winner\">QSPM #1 (TAS 6.620)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-title\">Compact Fresh Supermarkets (Hyfresh)</div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-banner-row\">\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">Hyfresh</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">Primo</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">Hy-Express</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"rec-card-desc\">Scale 500–1,000 m² neighborhood fresh stores in high-density residential hubs; consolidate sub-scale banners under master brand 'Hy-'.</p>\n    <div class=\"rec-kpi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">75–100</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">New Stores</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">35%+</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Fresh Share</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">25.0M</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Sales/m²</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-foot\">\n      <span class=\"rec-click-hint\">Inspect strategic fit &rarr;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- STRATEGY 2 -->\n  <div class=\"rec-card p-modern\" data-rec=\"r2\" onclick=\"selectRecommendation('r2')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"rec-card-top\">\n      <span class=\"rec-card-tag tag-modern\">STRATEGY 2 · OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCY</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-qspm-badge comp\">QSPM #2 (TAS 5.460)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-title\">Hypermarket Rightsizing &amp; Dark Stores</div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-banner-row\">\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">Hypermart</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">GrabMart</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">Shopee</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"rec-card-desc\">Downsize 30+ 5,000–8,000 m² hypermarkets to 2,500–3,500 m²; convert backrooms into cold-chain dark fulfillment hubs for rapid 60-min delivery.</p>\n    <div class=\"rec-kpi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">30+</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Stores Resized</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">10%+</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Online GMV</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">15 Min</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Picking SLA</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-foot\">\n      <span class=\"rec-click-hint\">Inspect strategic fit &rarr;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- STRATEGY 3 -->\n  <div class=\"rec-card p-moat\" data-rec=\"r3\" onclick=\"selectRecommendation('r3')\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"rec-card-top\">\n      <span class=\"rec-card-tag tag-moat\">STRATEGY 3 · BALANCE SHEET MOAT</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-qspm-badge moat\">SELF-FUNDING</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-title\">PSAK 73 Restructuring &amp; Divestitures</div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-banner-row\">\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">Lease Exit</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">SmartClub</span>\n      <span class=\"rec-fmt-pill\">FMX Exit</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"rec-card-desc\">Shift fixed leases to 12–15% variable turnover rent; liquidate loss-making SmartClub wholesale &amp; FMX kiosks to fund growth without bank debt.</p>\n    <div class=\"rec-kpi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">+120B</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Asset Inflow</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">~36B/yr</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">Rent Savings</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rec-kpi-item\">\n        <span class=\"kpi-val\">Rp 0</span>\n        <span class=\"kpi-lbl\">New Debt</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rec-card-foot\">\n      <span class=\"rec-click-hint\">Inspect strategic fit &rarr;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- INSPECTOR BOTTOM -->\n<div class=\"rec-inspector\" id=\"rec-ins-box\">\n  <div class=\"rec-ins-header\">\n    <span class=\"rec-ins-badge\" id=\"rec-ins-badge\">STRATEGY 1 · EXPANSION &amp; FRESH VALUE CHAIN</span>\n    <h3 class=\"rec-ins-title\" id=\"rec-ins-title\">Compact Fresh Supermarkets (Hyfresh) Rollout &amp; Master Brand Architecture</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rec-ins-body\" id=\"rec-ins-body\">\n    <!-- Injected dynamically via JavaScript -->\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"deck-footer\"><span>Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 5 &amp; 6; Sample PPT Slide 30; Case 23 pp. 587–596 · Audited AR2020</span><span>29 / 30</span></div>"},
  {"label": "Slide 30: Sources & Uses of Funds (Capital Budgeting)", "short": "Sources & Uses", "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategy implementation · Stage 4 · Capital budgeting</div>\n<h2>Sources &amp; Uses of Funds: Capital Budgeting Plan (2021–2025)</h2>\n<p class=\"rec-subtitle\">5-Year Capital Budgeting Blueprint: Select any source or disbursement item to review operational mechanisms and debt covenant safeguards</p>\n\n<div class=\"capex-tabs-bar\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Slide 30 Sub-Navigation\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"capex-tab-btn is-active\" id=\"tab-btn-budget\" onclick=\"switchCapexTab('budget')\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n    <span>📊</span><span>Sources & Uses Budgeting</span>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"capex-tab-btn\" id=\"tab-btn-map\" onclick=\"switchCapexTab('map')\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n    <span>🗺️</span><span>Store Rollout Expansion Map (50 Hyfresh & 45 Dark Stores)</span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n\n\n<div id=\"capex-view-budget\" class=\"capex-tab-content\">\n<!-- Top 3-Metric Executive Banner (Standard Financial Terminology) -->\n<div class=\"capex-kpi-bar\">\n  <div class=\"capex-kpi-cell\">\n    <div class=\"capex-kpi-val-group\">\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-val text-green\">+Rp 450.0B</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"capex-kpi-txt\">\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-lbl\">Total Sources of Funds</span>\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-sub\">40% Lease Restructuring · 33% Operating Cash · 27% Divestitures</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"capex-kpi-cell\">\n    <div class=\"capex-kpi-val-group\">\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-val\">Rp 450.0B</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"capex-kpi-txt\">\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-lbl\">Total Capital Expenditures (CapEx)</span>\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-sub\">50% Hyfresh Expansion · 30% Rightsizing · 20% Supply Chain</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"capex-kpi-cell\">\n    <div class=\"capex-kpi-val-group\">\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-val text-green\">Rp 0.0B</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"capex-kpi-txt\">\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-lbl\">Net External Debt Financing</span>\n      <span class=\"capex-kpi-sub\">100% Internally Funded · Preserves BNI Credit Covenants</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"funding-main-split\">\n  <!-- LEFT: SOURCES (TOP), USES (BOTTOM), SCHEDULE & COVENANTS -->\n  <div class=\"funding-tables-col\">\n    <!-- 1. SOURCES OF FUNDS BOX (PUT AT TOP) -->\n    <div class=\"funding-box\">\n      <div class=\"funding-box-hdr\">\n        <h4><span class=\"capex-tag tag-sources\">SOURCES</span> Sources of Funds (Capital Sourced)</h4>\n        <span class=\"funding-box-total-pill\">Total Inflow: +Rp 450.0B (100.0%)</span>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"funding-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th style=\"width:58%;\">Funding Source / Capital Component</th>\n            <th class=\"th-num\" style=\"width:22%;\">Inflow</th>\n            <th class=\"th-num\" style=\"width:14%;\">Share</th>\n            <th style=\"width:6%;\"></th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row is-clickable is-active-funding-row\" data-funding-id=\"src-lease\" onclick=\"selectFundingItem('src-lease')\">\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-name\">PSAK 73 Lease Restructuring Savings <span class=\"funding-strat-badge b-strat3\">Strategy 3</span></div>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-sub\">15 anchor mall leases renegotiated (~Rp36B/yr cash relief)</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\" style=\"color:#059669;\">+Rp 180.0B</td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\">40.0%</td>\n            <td style=\"text-align:center; color:#df0036;\">→</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row is-clickable\" data-funding-id=\"src-cashflow\" onclick=\"selectFundingItem('src-cashflow')\">\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-name\">Operating Cash Flow Generation <span class=\"funding-strat-badge\" style=\"background:#ecfdf5;color:#047857;\">Strategies 1 &amp; 2</span></div>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-sub\">Turnaround retail cash from Hyfresh &amp; downsized hypermarkets</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\" style=\"color:#059669;\">+Rp 150.0B</td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\">33.3%</td>\n            <td style=\"text-align:center; color:#94a3b8;\">→</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row is-clickable\" data-funding-id=\"src-divest\" onclick=\"selectFundingItem('src-divest')\">\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-name\">Non-Core Asset Divestiture Proceeds <span class=\"funding-strat-badge b-strat3\">Strategy 3</span></div>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-sub\">Liquidation of SmartClub inventory &amp; FMX kiosk fixtures</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\" style=\"color:#059669;\">+Rp 120.0B</td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\">26.7%</td>\n            <td style=\"text-align:center; color:#94a3b8;\">→</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row-total\">\n            <td><strong>Total Sources of Funds</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\" style=\"color:#059669;\"><strong>+Rp 450.0B</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\"><strong>100.0%</strong></td>\n            <td></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 2. USES OF FUNDS BOX (DISBURSEMENT / CAPEX PUT AT BOTTOM) -->\n    <div class=\"funding-box\">\n      <div class=\"funding-box-hdr\">\n        <h4><span class=\"capex-tag tag-uses\">USES</span> Uses of Funds (Capital Disbursements / CapEx)</h4>\n        <span class=\"funding-box-total-pill\">Total CapEx: Rp 450.0B (100.0%)</span>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"funding-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th style=\"width:58%;\">Investment Initiative / Application</th>\n            <th class=\"th-num\" style=\"width:22%;\">Disbursement</th>\n            <th class=\"th-num\" style=\"width:14%;\">Share</th>\n            <th style=\"width:6%;\"></th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row is-clickable\" data-funding-id=\"use-hyfresh\" onclick=\"selectFundingItem('use-hyfresh')\">\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-name\">Hyfresh Supermarket Expansion <span class=\"funding-strat-badge b-strat1\">Strategy 1</span></div>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-sub\">50 compact fresh store fitouts @ Rp4.5B avg</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\">Rp 225.0B</td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\">50.0%</td>\n            <td style=\"text-align:center; color:#94a3b8;\">→</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row is-clickable\" data-funding-id=\"use-darkstore\" onclick=\"selectFundingItem('use-darkstore')\">\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-name\">Hypermarket Rightsizing &amp; Dark Fulfillment <span class=\"funding-strat-badge b-strat2\">Strategy 2</span></div>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-sub\">45 hypermarket floor conversions @ Rp3.0B avg</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\">Rp 135.0B</td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\">30.0%</td>\n            <td style=\"text-align:center; color:#94a3b8;\">→</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row is-clickable\" data-funding-id=\"use-coldchain\" onclick=\"selectFundingItem('use-coldchain')\">\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-name\">Cold Chain Logistics &amp; IT Omnichannel Systems <span class=\"funding-strat-badge b-infra\">Strategies 7 &amp; 8</span></div>\n              <div class=\"funding-row-sub\">Upgrades to 3 central distribution centers &amp; order routing</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\">Rp 90.0B</td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\">20.0%</td>\n            <td style=\"text-align:center; color:#94a3b8;\">→</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row-total\">\n            <td><strong>Total Planned Capital Expenditures</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\"><strong>Rp 450.0B</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\"><strong>100.0%</strong></td>\n            <td></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"funding-row-net\">\n            <td><strong>Net External Financing Required (Debt / Equity)</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"td-val\" style=\"color:#059669;\"><strong>Rp 0.0B</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"td-share\" style=\"color:#059669;\"><strong>0.0% (Fully Sourced)</strong></td>\n            <td></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 3. 5-YEAR CASH DEPLOYMENT SCHEDULE -->\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"funding-details-col\">\n    <div class=\"funding-inspector-col\">\n      <div class=\"funding-ins-img-wrap\">\n        <img id=\"ins-img\" class=\"funding-ins-img\" src=\"/assets/mall-anchor.jpg\" alt=\"Mall anchor tenant lease negotiation\">\n        <div id=\"ins-caption\" class=\"funding-ins-img-caption\">Renegotiating high-rent mall leases with anchor-tenant landlords across Indonesia</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"funding-ins-hdr\">\n        <div class=\"funding-ins-tag-row\">\n          <span id=\"ins-tag\" class=\"funding-ins-tag\">CAPITAL SOURCE · STRATEGY 3 (COST RESTRUCTURING)</span>\n          <span id=\"ins-share\" class=\"funding-ins-share\">40.0% of Capital Sourced</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 id=\"ins-title\" class=\"funding-ins-title\">PSAK 73 Lease Restructuring Savings</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"funding-metrics-bar\">\n        <div class=\"ins-metric-tile\">\n          <div id=\"ins-m1-val\" class=\"ins-metric-val\">+Rp 180.0B</div>\n          <div id=\"ins-m1-lbl\" class=\"ins-metric-lbl\">5-Yr Cash Relief</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ins-metric-tile\">\n          <div id=\"ins-m2-val\" class=\"ins-metric-val\">15 Leases</div>\n          <div id=\"ins-m2-lbl\" class=\"ins-metric-lbl\">Key Mall Contracts</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ins-metric-tile\">\n          <div id=\"ins-m3-val\" class=\"ins-metric-val\">Rp 0 Debt</div>\n          <div id=\"ins-m3-lbl\" class=\"ins-metric-lbl\">Non-Dilutive Cash</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n        <div class=\"funding-ins-card\">\n          <div class=\"funding-ins-card-title\"><span style=\"font-size:0.55cqw;\">🎯</span> <span id=\"ins-c1-title\">Operational Rationale &amp; Financial Mechanism</span></div>\n          <p id=\"ins-c1-text\" class=\"funding-ins-card-text\">Capitalizes on anchor tenant leverage to renegotiate 15 legacy mall leases from fixed high-rent commitments into hybrid revenue-share terms or downsized footprints, saving ~Rp 36.0B annually in cash occupancy and PSAK 73 right-of-use asset depreciation.</p>\n        </div>\n\n      <details class=\"funding-disclosure\">\n        <summary><span lang=\"en\">Accounting, rollout &amp; covenant details</span><span lang=\"id\">Detail akuntansi, pelaksanaan &amp; kovenan</span></summary>\n\n\n\n      <!-- Audit-Grade Accounting Basis & Statement Treatment -->\n      <div class=\"funding-ins-acct-badge\">\n        <div class=\"acct-badge-row\">\n          <span class=\"acct-pill-label\">ACCOUNTING BASIS:</span>\n          <span id=\"ins-acct-std\" class=\"acct-pill-val\">PSAK 73 / IFRS 16 Leases · AR2020 Notes 12, 19 &amp; 28</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"acct-badge-row\">\n          <span class=\"acct-pill-label\">STATEMENT LEDGER:</span>\n          <span id=\"ins-acct-flow\" class=\"acct-pill-val\">Dr. Lease Liabilities (Rp 180.0B) | Cr. Financing Cash Outflows Saved</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n        <div class=\"funding-ins-cards\">\n        <div class=\"funding-ins-card\">\n          <div class=\"funding-ins-card-title\"><span style=\"font-size:0.55cqw;\">📅</span> <span id=\"ins-c2-title\">5-Year Implementation Roadmap</span></div>\n          <ul id=\"ins-c2-list\" class=\"funding-ins-milestones\">\n            <li>Renegotiates 5 priority mall hypermarkets annually during 2021–2023 lease renewals.</li>\n            <li>Releases non-performing excess trading area back to landlords for boutique specialty tenants.</li>\n            <li>Converts fixed cash rent outflows directly into free cash flow for Hyfresh expansions.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"funding-ins-covenant-box\">\n          <div class=\"funding-covenant-badges\">\n            <div class=\"funding-cov-badge\">\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-lbl\" id=\"cov-b1-lbl\">Annual Relief</div>\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-val\" id=\"cov-b1-val\">Rp 36B/yr</div>\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-sub\" id=\"cov-b1-sub\">Cash occupancy</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"funding-cov-badge\">\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-lbl\" id=\"cov-b2-lbl\">5-Yr Total</div>\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-val\" id=\"cov-b2-val\">Rp 180B</div>\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-sub\" id=\"cov-b2-sub\">Cumulative inflow</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"funding-cov-badge\">\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-lbl\" id=\"cov-b3-lbl\">ROU Relief</div>\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-val\" id=\"cov-b3-val\">PSAK 73</div>\n              <div class=\"cov-badge-sub\" id=\"cov-b3-sub\">Balance sheet clean</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p id=\"ins-cov-text\" class=\"funding-covenant-text\">Immediate, contractual cash savings that improve MPPA’s coverage metrics without creating liabilities or diluting equity.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      </details>\n\n      <div class=\"funding-hint-text\">Select any line item on the left to review financial mechanisms &amp; covenant impacts</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n    <details class=\"funding-disclosure funding-support\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Five-year capital schedule</span><span lang=\"id\">Jadwal pendanaan lima tahun</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"funding-waterfall-card\">\n      <div class=\"funding-waterfall-hdr\">\n        <h4>5-Year Annual Capital Sourcing &amp; Disbursement Schedule</h4>\n        <span class=\"funding-box-total-pill\" style=\"background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;\">100% Balanced</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"funding-waterfall-grid\">\n        <div class=\"funding-year-cell\">\n          <div class=\"funding-year-lbl\">2021</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-val\">Rp 80.0B</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-sub\">Divest &amp; Leases</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"funding-year-cell\">\n          <div class=\"funding-year-lbl\">2022</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-val\">Rp 95.0B</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-sub\">Hyfresh &amp; DC Cold</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"funding-year-cell\">\n          <div class=\"funding-year-lbl\">2023</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-val\">Rp 100.0B</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-sub\">Peak Expansion</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"funding-year-cell\">\n          <div class=\"funding-year-lbl\">2024</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-val\">Rp 90.0B</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-sub\">Omnichannel Scale</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"funding-year-cell\">\n          <div class=\"funding-year-lbl\">2025</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-val\">Rp 85.0B</div>\n          <div class=\"funding-year-sub\">Self-Sustaining</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"funding-disclosure funding-support\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Debt covenant safeguards</span><span lang=\"id\">Perlindungan kovenan utang</span></summary>\n    <!-- 4. CAPITAL STRUCTURE & DEBT COVENANT SAFEGUARD -->\n    <div class=\"funding-covenant-moat-card\">\n      <div class=\"funding-cov-hdr\">\n        <h4><span>🛡️</span> Capital Structure &amp; Debt Covenant Safeguards</h4>\n        <span class=\"funding-box-total-pill\" style=\"background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;font-size:0.46cqw;\">Preserves BNI Facility</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"funding-cov-trajectory-grid\">\n        <div class=\"cov-traj-cell\">\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-lbl\">Debt / Equity</div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-vals\">1.62x → <span class=\"target\">0.45x</span></div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-sub\">Limit: ≤ 2.50x</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cov-traj-cell\">\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-lbl\">Interest Coverage</div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-vals\">-0.4x → <span class=\"target\">+3.85x</span></div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-sub\">Limit: ≥ 2.00x</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cov-traj-cell\">\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-lbl\">Current Ratio</div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-vals\">0.46x → <span class=\"target\">1.18x</span></div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-sub\">Working Cap Clean</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cov-traj-cell\">\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-lbl\">Altman Z-Score</div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-vals\">1.18 → <span class=\"target\">2.65</span></div>\n          <div class=\"cov-traj-sub\">Safe Zone Exit</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"funding-cov-note\">\n        <strong>Credit Covenant Safeguard:</strong> By matching planned disbursements strictly to internal cash generation and divestiture proceeds, MPPA eliminates external bank debt, safely safeguarding rollover credit facilities with PT Bank Negara Indonesia (Persero) Tbk (BNI).\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </details>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- 2. GEOSPATIAL MAP VIEW (TAB 2) -->\n<div id=\"capex-view-map\" class=\"capex-map-view\" style=\"display:none;\">\n  <!-- Map Top 4-KPI Bar -->\n  <div class=\"map-kpi-bar\">\n    <div class=\"map-kpi-cell\">\n      