  {"label": "Slide 31: Proposed Organizational Structure (Divisional by Format)", "short": "Proposed Org Structure", "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategic governance \u00b7 Stage 4 \u00b7 Fred David Ch. 7 framework</div><div class=\"slide-title-row\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:.2cqw;\">  <h2 style=\"font-size:1.42cqw;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.15;margin:0;\">Proposed Organizational Structure: Divisional Design by Format</h2>  <span style=\"font-size:.62cqw;font-weight:800;color:#df0036;background:#fff1f2;border:1px solid #ffe4e6;padding:.2cqw .5cqw;border-radius:4px;\">ALFRED CHANDLER: STRUCTURE FOLLOWS STRATEGY</span></div><p style=\"font-size:.67cqw;color:#475569;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 .35cqw 0;\">  Restructured under Fred David Chapter 7: Resolving CEO Elliot Dickson's span bottleneck via a dedicated COO, instituting 4 format-level SBU profit centers, and elevating cold logistics and omnichannel enablers.</p><div class=\"org-tree-canvas\">  <!-- Tier 1: Apex (Governance + CEO + Staff) -->  <div class=\"org-tier-apex\">    <!-- Left: Board of Commissioners -->    <div class=\"org-card-gov\">      <span class=\"org-gov-tag\">INDEPENDENT OVERSIGHT</span>      <div class=\"org-gov-title\">Board of Commissioners</div>      <div class=\"org-gov-sub\">Dewan Komisaris \u00b7 Audit &amp; Risk Committee \u00b7 Public Governance Separation</div>    </div>    <!-- Center: CEO Elliot Dickson -->    <div class=\"org-apex-center\">      <div class=\"org-card-ceo\">        <span class=\"org-ceo-tag\">PRESIDENT DIRECTOR &amp; CEO</span>        <div class=\"org-ceo-name\">Elliot Dickson</div>        <div class=\"org-ceo-mandate\">Corporate Turnaround Strategy \u00b7 Capital Allocation \u00b7 Solvency Oversight</div>      </div>    </div>    <!-- Right: Corporate C-Suite Staff -->    <div class=\"org-staff-group\">      <div class=\"org-card-staff\">        <span class=\"org-staff-tag\">CFO \u00b7 FIN</span>        <div class=\"org-staff-name\">Herry Senjaya</div>        <div class=\"org-staff-detail\">PSAK 73 &amp; Debt</div>      </div>      <div class=\"org-card-staff\">        <span class=\"org-staff-tag\">CIO \u00b7 TECH</span>        <div class=\"org-staff-name\">Iwan Goenadi</div>        <div class=\"org-staff-detail\">SAP &amp; APIs</div>      </div>      <div class=\"org-card-staff\">        <span class=\"org-staff-tag\">CHRO \u00b7 HR</span>        <div class=\"org-staff-name\">L. Kurniawan</div>        <div class=\"org-staff-detail\">Staff Upskilling</div>      </div>    </div>  </div>  <!-- Vertical Stem from CEO to COO -->  <div class=\"org-stem-v\"></div>  <!-- Tier 2: COO -->  <div class=\"org-tier-coo\">    <div class=\"org-card-coo\">      <span class=\"org-coo-badge\">\u2605 NEW EXECUTIVE APPOINTMENT \u00b7 RESOLVES EXHIBIT 1 BOTTLENECK (CASE P. 588) \u2605</span>      <div class=\"org-coo-title\">Chief Operating Officer (COO) \u2014 Retail Formats &amp; Operations</div>      <div class=\"org-coo-sub\">Single operational commander for all 4 SBUs and core logistics \u00b7 Unburdens CFO from retail firefighting</div>    </div>  </div>  <!-- Connector Tree: COO to Bus to 4 SBUs -->  <div class=\"org-stem-v\"></div>  <div class=\"org-tree-bus-row\">    <div class=\"org-tree-drop-stem\"></div>    <div class=\"org-tree-drop-stem\"></div>    <div class=\"org-tree-drop-stem\"></div>    <div class=\"org-tree-drop-stem\"></div>  </div>  <!-- Tier 3: 4 Divisional SBUs -->  <div class=\"org-tier-sbu-grid\">    <!-- SBU 1: Hyfresh (Core Growth) -->    <div class=\"org-card-sbu theme-growth\">      <div class=\"org-sbu-head\">        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-tag\">SBU 1 \u00b7 CORE GROWTH</span>        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-role\">QSPM #1</span>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-body\">        <div class=\"org-sbu-title\">President \u00b7 Hyfresh Compact Supermarkets</div>        <ul class=\"org-sbu-bullets\">          <li>50 New compact stores (500\u20131,000 m\u00b2) in residential clusters</li>          <li>Direct farm produce focus with &gt;35% perishables mix</li>          <li>Standalone format P&amp;L with localized weekly assortment</li>        </ul>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-kpi-footer\">        <span>\ud83c\udfaf Target: Rp 1,500B Sales by 2025 \u00b7 Positive EBITDA</span>      </div>    </div>    <!-- SBU 2: Hypermart (Restructuring) -->    <div class=\"org-card-sbu theme-rightsize\">      <div class=\"org-sbu-head\">        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-tag\">SBU 2 \u00b7 RESTRUCTURING</span>        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-role\">QSPM #2</span>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-body\">        <div class=\"org-sbu-title\">President \u00b7 Hypermart &amp; Rightsizing</div>        <ul class=\"org-sbu-bullets\">          <li>Downsize 45 anchor hypermarkets by 30\u201340% to 2,500 m\u00b2</li>          <li>Convert excess backrooms into dark fulfillment hubs</li>          <li>Sublease freed floor space to external retail tenants</li>        </ul>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-kpi-footer\">        <span>\ud83c\udfaf Target: Cut Rp 180B Lease Debt \u00b7 Negative Cash Cycle</span>      </div>    </div>    <!-- SBU 3: Specialty Halo -->    <div class=\"org-card-sbu theme-specialty\">      <div class=\"org-sbu-head\">        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-tag\">SBU 3 \u00b7 PREMIUM SPECIALTY</span>        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-role\">HALO RETAIL</span>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-body\">        <div class=\"org-sbu-title\">President \u00b7 Primo Gourmet &amp; Boston HBC</div>        <ul class=\"org-sbu-bullets\">          <li>9 Foodmart Primo upscale gourmet stores in tier-1 malls</li>          <li>62 Boston Health &amp; Beauty pharmacy store-in-store pods</li>          <li>High average ticket size and affluent customer loyalty</li>        </ul>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-kpi-footer\">        <span>\ud83c\udfaf Target: 28\u201332% Gross Margin \u00b7 +15% Basket Spend</span>      </div>    </div>    <!-- SBU 4: Divestiture Taskforce -->    <div class=\"org-card-sbu theme-exit\">      <div class=\"org-sbu-head\">        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-tag\">SBU 4 \u00b7 DIVESTITURE</span>        <span class=\"org-sbu-head-role\">2021\u20132022 TASKFORCE</span>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-body\">        <div class=\"org-sbu-title\">Head \u00b7 Non-Core Liquidation Office</div>        <ul class=\"org-sbu-bullets\">          <li>Orderly closure/sale of SmartClub Wholesale by 2022</li>          <li>Decommission 14 FMX kiosks and reassign store labor</li>          <li>Eliminate recurring annual operating cash drain</li>        </ul>      </div>      <div class=\"org-sbu-kpi-footer\">        <span>\ud83c\udfaf Target: Unlock +Rp 120B Cash \u00b7 Zero Bank Debt</span>      </div>    </div>  </div>  <!-- Enablers Divider -->  <div class=\"org-enablers-divider\">    <div class=\"org-enablers-line\"></div>    <span class=\"org-enablers-title\">Shared Operational Enablers (Reporting to COO)</span>    <div class=\"org-enablers-line\"></div>  </div>  <!-- Tier 4: 3 Shared Operational Enablers -->  <div class=\"org-tier-enablers-grid\">    <div class=\"org-card-enabler\">      <div class=\"org-enabler-icon\" style=\"background:#e0f2fe;color:#0284c7;\">\u2744\ufe0f</div>      <div class=\"org-enabler-info\">        <span class=\"org-enabler-badge\" style=\"color:#0284c7;\">HALAL COLD-CHAIN MOAT</span>        <div class=\"org-enabler-title\">VP \u00b7 Supply Chain &amp; Cold Logistics</div>        <div class=\"org-enabler-sub\">3 Central Multi-Temp DCs (66,755 m\u00b2) \u00b7 Direct Farm Refrigerated Inflow</div>      </div>    </div>    <div class=\"org-card-enabler\">      <div class=\"org-enabler-icon\" style=\"background:#e0e7ff;color:#4338ca;\">\u26a1</div>      <div class=\"org-enabler-info\">        <span class=\"org-enabler-badge\" style=\"color:#4338ca;\">30-MIN RAPID FULFILLMENT</span>        <div class=\"org-enabler-title\">VP \u00b7 Omnichannel &amp; Digital Commerce</div>        <div class=\"org-enabler-sub\">GrabMart, Shopee &amp; Tokopedia Integrations \u00b7 Hypermart Dark Hubs</div>      </div>    </div>    <div class=\"org-card-enabler\">      <div class=\"org-enabler-icon\" style=\"background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;\">\ud83c\udf31</div>      <div class=\"org-enabler-info\">        <span class=\"org-enabler-badge\" style=\"color:#15803d;\">750+ DIRECT FARM CONTRACTS</span>        <div class=\"org-enabler-title\">VP \u00b7 Merchandising &amp; Farm Sourcing</div>        <div class=\"org-enabler-sub\">Kyutae Park \u00b7 Direct Farmer Sourcing \u00b7 Dynamic Expiry Pricing Algorithms</div>      </div>    </div>  </div>  <!-- Footer Bar -->  <div class=\"org-footer-bar\">    <div>      <strong>Governance Single Thread:</strong> CEO leads corporate strategy &amp; solvency \u00b7 COO drives execution across 4 distinct format SBUs \u00b7 Cold Logistics &amp; O2O enable the fresh turnaround.    </div>    <div>      <strong>Case Reference:</strong> Case pp. 587\u2013588, Exhibit 1 \u00b7 Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 7    </div>  </div></div>"},
  {"label": "Slide 32: Proposed Vision & Mission (Fred David 9-Component Audit)", "short": "Proposed Vision & Mission", "html": "<div class=\"deck-kicker\">Strategic governance · Stage 4 · Fred David Ch. 2 framework</div><h2>Proposed Vision &amp; Mission: Strategic Turnaround Realignment</h2><!-- Top Card: Proposed Vision (2021–2025) --><div class=\"vis-vision-card\">  <div class=\"vis-card-header\">    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6cqw;\">      <span class=\"vis-tag\">PROPOSED VISION · 2021–2025</span>          </div>      </div>  <div class=\"vis-statement\">    “To become <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"Inspiring\" data-detail=\"Sets an aspiration to earn families’ trust through consistent freshness.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">Indonesia’s most trusted</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"Clear\" data-detail=\"Identifies the business as neighborhood fresh grocery across stores and digital channels.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">neighborhood fresh food and omnichannel grocery retailer</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"Futuristic\" data-detail=\"Sets a time horizon for the proposed strategic direction.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">by 2025</button>, <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"Concise\" data-detail=\"Expresses the customer promise within the same sentence as the strategic direction.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">delivering superior freshness, accessibility, and convenience to families</button> through <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"Unique\" data-detail=\"Identifies compact stores and the cold chain as the operating capabilities behind the promise.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">high-yield compact stores and nationwide cold-chain excellence</button>.”  </div>  </div><!-- Bottom Card: Proposed Mission Statement & 9-Component Audit --><div class=\"mis-card\">  <div class=\"vis-card-header\" style=\"margin-bottom:.35cqw;\">    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6cqw;\">      <span class=\"vis-tag\">PROPOSED MISSION STATEMENT</span>          </div>      </div>  <div class=\"mis-statement-box\" id=\"mis-statement-container\">    “We serve <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"1. Customers\" data-detail=\"Pivots from transient mall visitors to weekly high-frequency households.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">Indonesian families</button> by providing <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"2. Products/Services\" data-detail=\"Focuses on non-discretionary perishables (35%+ mix) immune to e-commerce.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">nutritious farm-fresh produce, certified meats, and everyday grocery essentials at affordable prices</button> across <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"3. Markets\" data-detail=\"Directly guides the 5-cluster geospatial store rollout across Java Spine.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">high-density residential neighborhoods nationwide</button>. Powered by <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"4. Technology\" data-detail=\"Scales GrabMart/Shopee digital orders, cutting markdown waste.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">real-time inventory systems and rapid omnichannel digital delivery</button>, our <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"7. Distinctive Competence\" data-detail=\"The unassailable competitive advantage over minimarket rivals.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">certified Halal cold-chain logistics network</button> ensures unmatched quality and freshness from farm to table. We conduct business with ethical integrity, <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"6. Philosophy\" data-detail=\"Protects supplier relationships; averts Transmart empty-shelf collapse.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">treating local farming partners fairly</button>, <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"8. Public Image\" data-detail=\"Tackles Indonesia’s Rp 330T food loss crisis via cold chain speed.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">minimizing food waste to protect our environment</button>, <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"9. Employees\" data-detail=\"Upskills staff into certified fresh produce advisors &amp; digital pickers.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">empowering our knowledgeable store associates to thrive</button>, and practicing <button type=\"button\" class=\"vis-phrase\" onpointermove=\"previewStatementLabel(event, this)\" onpointerleave=\"hideStatementLabel(this)\" data-label=\"5. Survival, Growth, &amp; Profitability\" data-detail=\"Halts 4 loss years (-Rp 3.53T); preserves BNI debt covenants with Rp 0 bank debt.\" onclick=\"openStatementDetail(this)\">disciplined capital allocation to generate sustainable profitable growth for our shareholders</button>.”  </div>  </div><span class=\"matrix-preview vis-phrase-preview\" aria-hidden=\"true\" hidden></span><dialog class=\"matrix-detail vis-detail\" aria-label=\"Statement detail\" onclick=\"if(event.target===this)this.close()\"><header class=\"matrix-detail-head\"><div class=\"matrix-detail-head-main\"><span class=\"matrix-kind-badge vis-detail-category\"></span><h3 class=\"vis-detail-label\"></h3></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"matrix-detail-close\" aria-label=\"Close\" onclick=\"this.closest('dialog').close()\">×</button></header><div class=\"vis-detail-content\"><blockquote class=\"vis-detail-quote\"></blockquote><p class=\"vis-detail-explanation\"></p><section class=\"vis-detail-source\"><strong></strong><p>Fred R. David et al., Strategic Management (2023), Ch. 2</p></section></div></dialog>"},
